WEBVTT

00:00:05.806 --> 00:00:07.808 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:41.091 --> 00:00:42.092 line:20%
EPISODE 9

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:43.844 line:20%
[man on phone]
<i>Hello, this is the restaurant, Naum.</i>

00:00:43.927 --> 00:00:45.971 line:20%
<i>We found your pen while cleaning.</i>

00:00:46.055 --> 00:00:50.017 line:20%
If you ever find it,
can you contact me through this number?

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.021 line:20%
[man] <i>I remembered that you asked us</i>
<i>to contact you if we ever found it.</i>

00:00:54.104 --> 00:00:56.106 line:20%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:00:59.401 --> 00:01:01.987 line:20%
I think you owe me an explanation.

00:01:05.157 --> 00:01:07.242 line:20%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:01:16.418 --> 00:01:17.711 line:80%
[breathes heavily]

00:01:17.795 --> 00:01:19.922 line:80%
[Haran] The location of the engraving,
and the font.

00:01:20.005 --> 00:01:22.007 line:80%
Both of them are my pen.

00:01:22.091 --> 00:01:23.258 line:80%
How can this happen?

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:25.511 line:80%
I…

00:01:26.762 --> 00:01:28.514 line:80%
[hesitates] I bought it before.

00:01:28.597 --> 00:01:29.640 line:80%
What do you mean?

00:01:30.391 --> 00:01:31.725 line:80%
How could you have--

00:01:31.809 --> 00:01:33.102 line:80%
I bought the same pen

00:01:35.312 --> 00:01:36.897 line:80%
when I was in the States.

00:01:38.524 --> 00:01:40.943 line:80%
<i>When I first ran into you at the atelier,</i>

00:01:41.026 --> 00:01:43.570 line:80%
<i>I was shocked when I saw your pen</i>

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:45.614 line:80%
because it was so familiar.

00:01:50.828 --> 00:01:53.414 line:80%
So you bought it when you returned
to the States?

00:01:53.497 --> 00:01:54.623 line:80%
You got the same one?

00:01:56.417 --> 00:01:57.418 line:80%
Yes.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:00.421 line:80%
[sighs]

00:02:01.255 --> 00:02:04.299 line:80%
You should've told me.
I was so confused when I got this.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:09.054 line:80%
I thought it was a special pen
made just for me,

00:02:10.014 --> 00:02:12.057 line:80%
but I guess it's common in the US.

00:02:13.726 --> 00:02:15.352 line:80%
You could've said you bought it.

00:02:15.436 --> 00:02:17.271 line:80%
Did you think I'd feel uncomfortable?

00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:22.067 line:80%
You really are an artist,
paying attention to so much detail.

00:02:22.151 --> 00:02:23.819 line:80%
The engraving's exactly the same.

00:02:24.403 --> 00:02:28.615 line:80%
It's just like you to go
and buy another one for me.

00:02:30.784 --> 00:02:31.827 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:02:33.704 --> 00:02:34.705 line:80%
I…

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:40.836 line:80%
lied to you.

00:02:40.919 --> 00:02:42.713 line:80%
You did it for me.

00:02:42.796 --> 00:02:44.298 line:80%
I'll use it well. Thank you.

00:02:45.341 --> 00:02:46.884 line:80%
It might be an ordinary pen,

00:02:46.967 --> 00:02:49.845 line:80%
but the thought
behind buying it for me is special.

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:51.805 line:80%
So thank you.

00:02:53.057 --> 00:02:55.059 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:02:55.142 --> 00:02:56.852 line:80%
What is it this time?

00:02:56.935 --> 00:02:58.896 line:80%
What on earth is going on with you?

00:03:03.942 --> 00:03:04.943 line:80%
Mmm...

00:03:05.027 --> 00:03:06.153 line:80%
You caught me.

00:03:07.946 --> 00:03:08.947 line:80%
[sniffles]

00:03:09.698 --> 00:03:10.991 line:80%
I'm going to France soon.

00:03:11.075 --> 00:03:12.326 line:80%
France?

00:03:13.452 --> 00:03:14.453 line:80%
When?

00:03:14.536 --> 00:03:16.747 line:80%
Probably before spring.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:18.666 line:80%
[sighs deeply]

00:03:18.749 --> 00:03:19.833 line:80%
Spring?

00:03:21.043 --> 00:03:25.047 line:80%
I was planning on retiring and going there
when I was around 60.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.342 line:80%
But my plans got postponed
because of my daughter and son-in-law.

00:03:29.385 --> 00:03:31.970 line:80%
I haven't told the kids yet,

00:03:33.597 --> 00:03:35.349 line:80%
but I really want a break now.

00:03:35.432 --> 00:03:38.644 line:80%
I've been working my butt off
for the past 50 years.

00:03:39.645 --> 00:03:40.646 line:80%
Is that…

00:03:41.522 --> 00:03:42.523 line:80%
really it?

00:03:42.982 --> 00:03:43.983 line:80%
Of course.

00:03:44.066 --> 00:03:45.067 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.152 line:80%
I wish I'd reunited with you sooner.

00:03:48.362 --> 00:03:49.363 line:80%
It's just too bad.

00:03:50.656 --> 00:03:52.658 line:80%
I have a lot on my mind these days.

00:03:53.158 --> 00:03:55.077 line:80%
There's so much
to take care of before I go.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.246 line:80%
That's why I wanted to go
to Chuncheon soon.

00:03:57.329 --> 00:03:58.497 line:80%
Why did you go to the hospital?

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.417 line:80%
You weren't visiting a friend.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.169 line:80%
I saw a nurse…

00:04:06.213 --> 00:04:07.214 line:80%
calling your name.

00:04:07.297 --> 00:04:08.298 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:04:08.799 --> 00:04:11.385 line:80%
You think it's easy
managing a company until this age?

00:04:11.885 --> 00:04:14.930 line:80%
My health is my asset,
so I get regular checkups.

00:04:15.014 --> 00:04:16.348 line:80%
I just didn't want you to worry.

00:04:17.599 --> 00:04:19.852 line:80%
Anyway, let's go to Chuncheon soon.

00:04:22.021 --> 00:04:25.190 line:80%
I wonder if our house is still there.
[giggles]

00:04:28.319 --> 00:04:30.571 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:04:43.417 --> 00:04:45.085 line:80%
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:04:45.169 --> 00:04:46.503 line:80%
[sighs]

00:04:46.587 --> 00:04:47.963 line:80%
This is it.

00:05:27.503 --> 00:05:29.254 line:80%
<i>You did it for me.</i>

00:05:29.338 --> 00:05:30.631 line:80%
<i>So thank you.</i>

00:05:31.423 --> 00:05:35.302 line:80%
[Chan] <i>The more you gain with deception,</i>

00:05:35.386 --> 00:05:37.388 line:80%
<i>the less you can truly gain.</i>

00:05:37.471 --> 00:05:39.556 line:80%
<i>It may seem like</i>
<i>you're gaining something now,</i>

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:42.017 line:80%
<i>but you'll probably end up</i>
<i>paying the price for it.</i>

00:05:42.101 --> 00:05:43.602 line:80%
[inhales]

00:05:44.728 --> 00:05:46.188 line:80%
[tuts, sighs in frustration]

00:05:48.941 --> 00:05:49.984 line:80%
[metallic clink]

00:05:52.027 --> 00:05:54.113 line:80%
[door opens, closes]

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.166 line:80%
[metallic clink]

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.258 line:80%
[metallic clinking echoes]

00:06:14.341 --> 00:06:15.467 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:06:15.551 --> 00:06:17.970 line:80%
-[rapid metallic clink echoes]
-[groans]

00:06:19.346 --> 00:06:20.806 line:80%
[toy squeaks]

00:06:20.889 --> 00:06:22.891 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:06:22.975 --> 00:06:24.977 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:06:27.271 --> 00:06:29.857 line:80%
-[toy squeaks]
-[panting]

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.071 line:80%
[Chan] <i>The price…</i>

00:06:42.036 --> 00:06:44.288 line:80%
[♪ music swells, fades]

00:06:44.371 --> 00:06:46.957 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[birds chirping]

00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:48.959 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:06:49.043 --> 00:06:50.336 line:80%
[sizzling]

00:06:50.419 --> 00:06:52.671 line:80%
[Hayeong] Gosh, that's hot! I almost died.

00:06:52.755 --> 00:06:54.798 line:80%
[objects clattering]

00:06:54.882 --> 00:06:56.050 line:80%
[mumbles] Be quiet…

00:07:02.222 --> 00:07:03.265 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:09.188 --> 00:07:10.230 line:80%
The porridge.

00:07:10.314 --> 00:07:11.690 line:80%
[Taeseok sighs wearily]

00:07:19.448 --> 00:07:20.449 line:80%
Ms. Song?

00:07:21.158 --> 00:07:23.077 line:80%
[exclaims] You're awake.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.495 line:80%
-What are you doing here?
-[Hayeong] Uh...

00:07:24.578 --> 00:07:27.122 line:80%
I came to drop off some documents,

00:07:27.206 --> 00:07:28.666 line:80%
but I guess you don't remember.

00:07:28.749 --> 00:07:30.167 line:80%
Are you feeling better?

00:07:30.751 --> 00:07:31.794 line:80%
What is all this?

00:07:31.877 --> 00:07:35.714 line:80%
How can you only have water
and candy at home?

00:07:35.798 --> 00:07:39.385 line:80%
So I ordered some pots
and dishes and stuff.

00:07:39.843 --> 00:07:41.261 line:80%
Delivery is awesome in Korea!

00:07:42.137 --> 00:07:43.639 line:80%
Sit down. The porridge is done.

00:07:44.139 --> 00:07:46.225 line:80%
It's late. You should go.

00:07:46.809 --> 00:07:47.935 line:80%
-I'll take you--
-[Hayeong exclaims]

00:07:48.018 --> 00:07:49.853 line:80%
Don't be silly. You're sick.

00:07:51.897 --> 00:07:56.110 line:80%
There's nothing more miserable
than being alone when you're sick.

00:07:56.193 --> 00:07:57.778 line:80%
So stay right here.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.322 line:80%
Ah, pardon me for a moment.

00:08:02.282 --> 00:08:03.951 line:80%
Okay. Your fever dropped.

00:08:04.034 --> 00:08:07.246 line:80%
The pear tea's almost done, too.
It's the best for a cold.

00:08:09.832 --> 00:08:12.126 line:80%
[Hyunwoo]
<i>I don't think I should see Hayeong.</i>

00:08:12.209 --> 00:08:13.836 line:80%
<i>She kept talking about you.</i>

00:08:14.545 --> 00:08:16.130 line:80%
<i>I think she likes you a lot.</i>

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:17.715 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:08:17.798 --> 00:08:19.258 line:80%
[Hayeong exclaims] <i>Really?</i>

00:08:19.341 --> 00:08:21.969 line:80%
-Top of his year the whole time?
-Yes. The entire time.

00:08:22.052 --> 00:08:23.846 line:80%
Wow. He was a genius.

00:08:23.929 --> 00:08:26.181 line:80%
His nickname was Yeon Taeseop,

00:08:26.265 --> 00:08:28.684 line:80%
like Song Taeseop from <i>Slam Dunk.</i>

00:08:28.767 --> 00:08:29.768 line:80%
[both laughing]

00:08:29.852 --> 00:08:33.022 line:80%
Yeon Taeseop? So?
Did he enter competitions and stuff?

00:08:33.105 --> 00:08:35.399 line:80%
[Hyunwoo] Of course. For competitions, he…

00:08:36.984 --> 00:08:39.611 line:80%
Here. Unfortunately,
I can't guarantee the taste.

00:08:41.447 --> 00:08:42.781 line:80%
I'll eat it when you leave.

00:08:42.865 --> 00:08:44.950 line:80%
-It's late, so--
-No.

00:08:45.034 --> 00:08:47.036 line:80%
I'll leave after I see you
finishing the bowl.

00:08:47.995 --> 00:08:52.082 line:80%
You were the one who told me
to be honest if I wasn't okay.

00:08:52.166 --> 00:08:54.418 line:80%
Why didn't you tell me you were sick?

00:08:55.085 --> 00:08:56.086 line:80%
I…

00:08:57.171 --> 00:08:58.964 line:80%
shouldn't be sick.

00:08:59.048 --> 00:09:00.049 line:80%
Huh?

00:09:00.132 --> 00:09:02.009 line:80%
Why would anyone
not be allowed to be sick?

00:09:02.092 --> 00:09:03.302 line:80%
You just have to get better.

00:09:04.136 --> 00:09:05.262 line:80%
Eat up before it gets cold.

00:09:07.014 --> 00:09:08.015 line:80%
All right.

00:09:14.521 --> 00:09:15.522 line:80%
Mr. Yeon.

00:09:16.148 --> 00:09:18.567 line:80%
I'll get straight to the point.

00:09:19.652 --> 00:09:22.529 line:80%
I've been getting my hopes up these days.

00:09:23.489 --> 00:09:26.116 line:80%
I thought you were blushing and sweating

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:30.245 line:80%
because you had feelings for me.
I didn't know you were sick.

00:09:30.329 --> 00:09:32.831 line:80%
But to be honest,

00:09:33.791 --> 00:09:34.792 line:80%
I was happy.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:40.464 line:80%
Mr. Yeon, even seeing you with bedhead
makes me curious.

00:09:40.547 --> 00:09:43.801 line:80%
I find myself overthinking
everything you do or say.

00:09:43.884 --> 00:09:46.178 line:80%
And it hurts to see you sick.

00:09:46.637 --> 00:09:48.889 line:80%
I guess I've been denying my feelings,

00:09:48.973 --> 00:09:50.849 line:80%
but I'm sure of it now.

00:09:51.558 --> 00:09:53.185 line:80%
-Mr. Yeon.
-Ms. Song.

00:09:53.268 --> 00:09:54.853 line:80%
I think I like you.

00:09:54.937 --> 00:09:56.397 line:80%
No, I'm sure I like you.

00:10:02.027 --> 00:10:03.028 line:80%
If…

00:10:04.029 --> 00:10:06.657 line:80%
I gave you the wrong idea, I'm sorry.

00:10:08.117 --> 00:10:11.328 line:80%
But I've never thought of you…

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:14.748 line:80%
as more than a colleague.

00:10:14.832 --> 00:10:16.500 line:80%
Yes, of course.

00:10:17.126 --> 00:10:18.335 line:80%
I thought so.

00:10:18.419 --> 00:10:19.503 line:80%
Mmm...

00:10:19.586 --> 00:10:20.587 line:80%
Then…

00:10:22.548 --> 00:10:23.924 line:80%
start thinking of me that way.

00:10:24.008 --> 00:10:26.218 line:80%
[♪ heart-fluttering music playing]

00:10:26.885 --> 00:10:30.973 line:80%
I guess you'll only eat comfortably
once I'm gone.

00:10:31.056 --> 00:10:34.893 line:80%
[chuckles] Then I hope you get well soon.

00:10:34.977 --> 00:10:36.437 line:80%
I'll see you at work.

00:10:38.772 --> 00:10:40.065 line:80%
Ms. Song.

00:10:40.149 --> 00:10:42.151 line:80%
[♪ heart-fluttering music continues]

00:10:50.492 --> 00:10:53.203 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>Don't forget</i>
<i>to take this three times a day.</i>

00:10:59.835 --> 00:11:00.836 line:80%
[exhales]

00:11:00.919 --> 00:11:02.129 line:80%
I must be crazy.

00:11:02.838 --> 00:11:04.340 line:80%
I told him I like him.

00:11:06.133 --> 00:11:08.969 line:80%
But it's fine.
I was just telling him the truth.

00:11:09.887 --> 00:11:11.180 line:80%
Good job, Song Hayeong.

00:11:11.764 --> 00:11:14.058 line:80%
[inhales, squeals]

00:11:14.141 --> 00:11:16.101 line:80%
What do I do?

00:11:19.396 --> 00:11:21.398 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:11:35.663 --> 00:11:37.498 line:80%
[Hadam muttering] Please let Yougyum…

00:11:38.957 --> 00:11:40.751 line:80%
be okay.

00:11:42.461 --> 00:11:43.671 line:80%
Please…

00:11:43.754 --> 00:11:45.506 line:80%
[Yougyum's father] Good job, Yougyum.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:48.801 line:80%
[Hadam gasps] Yougyum, your foot.

00:11:48.884 --> 00:11:50.302 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:11:51.804 --> 00:11:52.805 line:80%
What did they say?

00:11:55.766 --> 00:11:57.476 line:80%
I've recovered. [chuckles]

00:11:57.559 --> 00:11:59.979 line:80%
I'll be perfectly healed
after some treatment.

00:12:00.854 --> 00:12:02.940 line:80%
It must have swollen from exhaustion.

00:12:03.524 --> 00:12:05.442 line:80%
I'll be fine in a week.

00:12:05.567 --> 00:12:08.320 line:80%
-You must have been shocked.
-[sighs in relief]

00:12:08.404 --> 00:12:10.030 line:80%
[Yougyum's father exclaims]

00:12:10.114 --> 00:12:11.699 line:80%
I'm so relieved.

00:12:12.491 --> 00:12:14.660 line:80%
You were in the nurse's office
because of your foot, right?

00:12:14.743 --> 00:12:16.787 line:80%
-[♪ amusing music playing]
-It was my fault.

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:19.415 line:80%
I misunderstood and threw a fit,

00:12:19.498 --> 00:12:21.458 line:80%
and I made you worry about me.

00:12:21.542 --> 00:12:23.210 line:80%
-[Hadam exhales]
-[Yougyum] Goodness.

00:12:23.293 --> 00:12:25.504 line:80%
I thought you were smart,
but you were a fool.

00:12:26.213 --> 00:12:27.423 line:80%
That's nonsense.

00:12:27.506 --> 00:12:30.217 line:80%
[voice shaking] I thought you wouldn't
be able to play baseball again.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:32.428 line:80%
Hadam! It's an emergency. Get up.

00:12:32.511 --> 00:12:34.930 line:80%
What is it? Is your foot hurting?

00:12:35.014 --> 00:12:36.140 line:80%
No.

00:12:36.974 --> 00:12:40.728 line:80%
You're wasting your time here
when the CSAT is just around the corner.

00:12:40.811 --> 00:12:43.397 line:80%
Hurry home and get some rest.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.149 line:80%
I'm going to nurse you.

00:12:45.232 --> 00:12:46.358 line:80%
Really?

00:12:46.984 --> 00:12:49.278 line:80%
Then I should go home
instead of getting treated.

00:12:49.945 --> 00:12:52.323 line:80%
Okay, fine. I'll go.

00:12:52.406 --> 00:12:56.535 line:80%
Don't worry, and focus on the CSAT.
We'll take good care of him.

00:12:56.618 --> 00:12:59.663 line:80%
Don't think about coming before the exams.
I won't even let you in.

00:12:59.747 --> 00:13:02.791 line:80%
I'll get plenty of rest
and receive treatment.

00:13:02.875 --> 00:13:04.918 line:80%
So let's meet after the exams, okay?

00:13:05.002 --> 00:13:06.628 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:13:06.712 --> 00:13:07.880 line:80%
Focus!

00:13:07.963 --> 00:13:09.423 line:80%
Focus. [sniffling]

00:13:11.717 --> 00:13:14.178 line:20%
I want you in charge of this.

00:13:14.261 --> 00:13:16.263 line:80%
The overall visuals
for a fashion editorial?

00:13:16.347 --> 00:13:17.890 line:80%
You always did this yourself…

00:13:17.973 --> 00:13:20.851 line:80%
This shoot is about showcasing
the brand's identity.

00:13:20.934 --> 00:13:24.563 line:80%
It's about time
we aligned it with your pace.

00:13:25.189 --> 00:13:28.067 line:80%
Plan the mood, color scheme,
and the flow of the looks.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.819 line:80%
As you said, we're showcasing
the brand's overall tone.

00:13:30.903 --> 00:13:31.904 line:80%
You should handle--

00:13:31.987 --> 00:13:34.448 line:80%
What do you think, Mr. Yeon?
Will it be hard for her?

00:13:35.032 --> 00:13:37.534 line:80%
I believe she can do it.

00:13:37.618 --> 00:13:39.828 line:80%
I'll support you with anything you need.

00:13:39.912 --> 00:13:41.288 line:80%
Okay. Then that's done.

00:13:41.372 --> 00:13:46.043 line:80%
From now on, prioritize Ms. Song's opinion
when adjusting colors and quantities.

00:13:46.126 --> 00:13:48.796 line:80%
What? Ms. Kim…

00:13:48.879 --> 00:13:50.089 line:80%
Why are you--

00:13:50.172 --> 00:13:51.590 line:80%
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:13:52.424 --> 00:13:54.551 line:80%
You should take some of my workload.

00:13:54.635 --> 00:13:56.512 line:80%
Let me get some rest, too.

00:13:57.096 --> 00:13:59.890 line:80%
Ah. And clear my schedule
for a day this week.

00:13:59.974 --> 00:14:01.225 line:80%
-Is there something…
-What…

00:14:02.768 --> 00:14:03.811 line:80%
Go ahead.

00:14:04.853 --> 00:14:05.896 line:80%
Is something wrong?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.898 line:80%
You never asked
to clear a schedule before.

00:14:07.982 --> 00:14:11.568 line:80%
It's just that I want some fresh air
before it gets too cold.

00:14:11.652 --> 00:14:13.946 line:80%
-Then I'll take you--
-It's fine. I can go on my own.

00:14:15.614 --> 00:14:16.699 line:80%
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:16.782 --> 00:14:17.866 line:80%
But, Ms. Kim,

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:19.535 line:80%
-I really don't think I should do--
-[Nana claps]

00:14:19.618 --> 00:14:20.786 line:80%
Meeting's over.

00:14:23.372 --> 00:14:24.707 line:80%
[sighs]

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.625 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:14:32.172 --> 00:14:33.716 line:80%
Will I have enough time?

00:14:35.134 --> 00:14:36.135 line:80%
No.

00:14:37.553 --> 00:14:39.221 line:80%
I have to get it done.

00:14:45.436 --> 00:14:47.771 line:80%
Uh, she has a personal appointment.

00:14:48.314 --> 00:14:50.733 line:80%
All right.
Please postpone it to next week.

00:14:51.692 --> 00:14:52.693 line:80%
[clears throat]

00:14:53.819 --> 00:14:55.779 line:80%
Good afternoon.

00:14:56.613 --> 00:14:58.157 line:80%
Are you feeling better?

00:14:58.949 --> 00:15:00.576 line:80%
-Yes, thanks to you.
-[elevator dings]

00:15:02.161 --> 00:15:03.203 line:80%
[Hayeong sighs]

00:15:07.583 --> 00:15:11.211 line:80%
Song Hayeong, age 29, ENFP.
And ENFJ when I'm working.

00:15:11.754 --> 00:15:15.591 line:80%
I like my family, friends,
colleagues, work, driving,

00:15:15.674 --> 00:15:17.593 line:80%
listening to music while walking
on a windy day,

00:15:17.676 --> 00:15:18.927 line:80%
being honest, tasty food,

00:15:19.011 --> 00:15:20.387 line:80%
especially snack bar food.

00:15:20.471 --> 00:15:22.765 line:80%
Mmm... And watching
cute videos before bed.

00:15:22.848 --> 00:15:24.391 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:15:24.475 --> 00:15:26.060 line:80%
-What?
-And what I don't like

00:15:26.143 --> 00:15:27.561 line:80%
are people who are frustrating,

00:15:27.645 --> 00:15:30.939 line:80%
cowardly, who pick on the weak,
stir up conflict, snitch, get paranoid.

00:15:31.023 --> 00:15:32.566 line:80%
And I hate losing people I love,

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:34.401 line:80%
seeing them in pain...

00:15:34.943 --> 00:15:37.071 line:80%
Ah, and mosquitoes.

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:41.533 line:80%
Oh, and I forgot one.

00:15:41.617 --> 00:15:45.412 line:80%
Recently, something was added
to the list of things I like.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:50.626 line:80%
-[elevator dings]
-What are you doing?

00:15:53.003 --> 00:15:55.089 line:80%
We don't know much
about each other personally,

00:15:55.172 --> 00:15:56.882 line:80%
even after all these years.

00:15:56.965 --> 00:16:00.302 line:80%
I told you to think about me,
but I thought you wouldn't have much info,

00:16:00.386 --> 00:16:01.970 line:80%
so I gave you some.

00:16:08.227 --> 00:16:10.020 line:80%
Ah, I'm not pressuring you.

00:16:10.104 --> 00:16:13.524 line:80%
You're always serious and prudent,
so you can take your time.

00:16:13.607 --> 00:16:15.234 line:80%
It's all right with me.

00:16:15.317 --> 00:16:18.779 line:80%
But everyone ends up liking me
the more they get to know me.

00:16:18.862 --> 00:16:21.281 line:80%
I'm just saying.

00:16:22.408 --> 00:16:25.828 line:80%
Having personal conversations
like this at work isn't really…

00:16:25.911 --> 00:16:26.954 line:80%
[Hayeong exclaims]

00:16:27.579 --> 00:16:31.083 line:80%
Mr. Yeon doesn't like
personal conversations at work.

00:16:31.959 --> 00:16:33.085 line:80%
[in English] Okay.

00:16:33.168 --> 00:16:36.005 line:80%
[in Korean] I just acquired
some more info about you.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.841 line:80%
Then have a good day.

00:16:41.218 --> 00:16:43.220 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:16:45.264 --> 00:16:47.099 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:16:47.182 --> 00:16:49.268 line:80%
[Chan in English]
So, what do you think about this scene?

00:16:49.351 --> 00:16:51.979 line:80%
[Ben] Um...
Yeah, I mean, it's good overall.

00:16:52.062 --> 00:16:53.522 line:80%
A few things here and there
we could tweak.

00:16:53.605 --> 00:16:56.358 line:80%
[in Korean] Oh! Ben, how have you been?

00:16:56.442 --> 00:16:58.819 line:80%
I've been doing very well. [chuckles]

00:16:58.902 --> 00:17:02.114 line:80%
My mother-in-law's food is amazing.
[laughs]

00:17:02.197 --> 00:17:05.868 line:80%
We were having a meeting
because we got the additional script.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.287 line:80%
We'll send it to the design team later.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.664 line:80%
All right. I'll let you work.
[chuckles softly]

00:17:11.999 --> 00:17:13.000 line:80%
Hi.

00:17:13.834 --> 00:17:14.835 line:80%
[Ben in English] Sounds good.

00:17:17.921 --> 00:17:19.423 line:80%
[sighs]

00:17:20.257 --> 00:17:21.300 line:80%
Good meeting.

00:17:21.383 --> 00:17:22.885 line:80%
[lively chatter]

00:17:22.968 --> 00:17:24.553 line:80%
[in Korean]
Should I raise the neckline a bit?

00:17:24.636 --> 00:17:26.138 line:80%
[Ben and Chan laughing]

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:29.016 line:80%
Mr. Park, the coffee.

00:17:29.099 --> 00:17:30.100 line:80%
[Manjae] Oh, gosh.

00:17:30.184 --> 00:17:31.185 line:80%
Goodness.

00:17:32.519 --> 00:17:34.021 line:80%
Uh, were you looking at this pen?

00:17:34.938 --> 00:17:37.358 line:80%
Mr. Seonu bought this for me.
[chuckles softly]

00:17:37.441 --> 00:17:39.443 line:80%
This must be common in the States.

00:17:39.526 --> 00:17:42.029 line:80%
He got it for me
when he went back last time.

00:17:42.112 --> 00:17:44.156 line:80%
He even put a lucky sticker on it.

00:17:44.239 --> 00:17:45.824 line:80%
Right… [chuckles nervously]

00:17:45.908 --> 00:17:48.494 line:80%
I'm glad you like it.

00:17:49.495 --> 00:17:50.496 line:80%
[sighs]

00:17:52.706 --> 00:17:56.293 line:80%
[♪ J.S. Bach "Goldberg Variations,
BWV 988: Aria" playing on speakers]

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:05.010 line:80%
I guess you like Bach.

00:18:05.094 --> 00:18:08.472 line:80%
No. I just happened
to hear about the song.

00:18:08.555 --> 00:18:11.850 line:80%
Someone told me it's good for insomnia.

00:18:21.819 --> 00:18:23.237 line:80%
[Manjae] The music is a bit sad.

00:18:23.779 --> 00:18:26.031 line:80%
I should change it to a brighter song.

00:18:27.574 --> 00:18:29.118 line:80%
-[inhales sharply]
-[♪ music stops]

00:18:35.332 --> 00:18:37.418 line:80%
[♪ pleasant jazz music
playing on speakers]

00:18:40.587 --> 00:18:42.840 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>Let her feel joy again.</i>

00:18:43.882 --> 00:18:47.386 line:80%
<i>Tell me anything. I'll be your safe space.</i>

00:18:51.724 --> 00:18:53.267 line:80%
[cellphone vibrates]

00:18:55.352 --> 00:18:57.521 line:80%
[Hadam] <i>Ta-da! I'm getting perfect scores.</i>

00:18:57.604 --> 00:18:59.023 line:80%
<i>I'm going to nail the CSAT.</i>

00:18:59.106 --> 00:19:01.859 line:80%
<i>How are you feeling? Is the food okay?</i>

00:19:01.942 --> 00:19:04.903 line:80%
[Yougyum] <i>Ta-da! I'm cleaning</i>
<i>all my plates, and I'm in great condition!</i>

00:19:04.987 --> 00:19:06.989 line:80%
<i>Don't worry about me and focus.</i>

00:19:07.656 --> 00:19:08.907 line:80%
Hmm!

00:19:08.991 --> 00:19:09.992 line:80%
Right. Focus.

00:19:13.245 --> 00:19:15.205 line:80%
[Chan murmuring in English]
"Won flew through the night sky.

00:19:15.289 --> 00:19:19.168 line:80%
"Below her, the Milky Way
was pouring down like a river."

00:19:19.251 --> 00:19:20.711 line:80%
Milky Way…

00:19:20.794 --> 00:19:23.255 line:80%
<i>Won flew through the night sky.</i>

00:19:23.797 --> 00:19:29.261 line:80%
<i>Below her, the Milky Way</i>
<i>was pouring down like a river.</i>

00:19:30.262 --> 00:19:31.263 line:80%
[Chan exclaims]

00:19:34.475 --> 00:19:35.893 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:19:43.692 --> 00:19:45.778 line:80%
[cellphone vibrating]

00:19:45.861 --> 00:19:46.862 line:80%
Hmm?

00:19:46.945 --> 00:19:49.365 line:80%
RAN

00:19:49.448 --> 00:19:50.699 line:80%
You haven't gone to bed?

00:19:50.783 --> 00:19:51.867 line:80%
Not yet.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:53.619 line:80%
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:19:55.329 --> 00:19:56.705 line:80%
But what are you up to?

00:19:56.789 --> 00:19:59.124 line:80%
There's a newly added scene
of the Milky Way,

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.335 line:80%
so I wanted to go see it.

00:20:02.086 --> 00:20:03.212 line:80%
Should we…

00:20:04.713 --> 00:20:06.757 line:80%
Oh, it's pretty late.

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.592 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Driving alone at this hour?</i>

00:20:09.259 --> 00:20:12.638 line:80%
That's not fair. We promised
to work through your list together.

00:20:12.721 --> 00:20:14.598 line:80%
<i>Stargazing was on your list.</i>

00:20:14.682 --> 00:20:17.893 line:80%
Going alone doesn't count.
I'll take my car and head there.

00:20:17.977 --> 00:20:19.061 line:80%
So just wait.

00:20:20.521 --> 00:20:21.689 line:80%
[Chan exclaims]

00:20:21.772 --> 00:20:25.150 line:80%
I guess the moon's in a good mood today.

00:20:25.693 --> 00:20:28.070 line:80%
We won't be able to see the Milky Way
if it's so bright.

00:20:28.153 --> 00:20:29.279 line:80%
Hmm?

00:20:29.363 --> 00:20:31.281 line:80%
We can't see it because of the moon?

00:20:31.907 --> 00:20:33.867 line:80%
The moon's pretty bright,

00:20:34.493 --> 00:20:38.163 line:80%
so faint lights like the Milky Way
get washed out by the light.

00:20:38.747 --> 00:20:40.332 line:80%
Oh...

00:20:40.416 --> 00:20:41.875 line:80%
[coughs]

00:20:41.959 --> 00:20:42.960 line:80%
It's cold, isn't it?

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:44.753 line:80%
Sorry, it's my fault.

00:20:46.463 --> 00:20:48.090 line:80%
Uh, can we use that?

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:52.761 line:80%
-Here.
-Thanks.

00:20:53.971 --> 00:20:55.055 line:80%
[Chan groans]

00:20:55.681 --> 00:20:57.182 line:80%
[hesitates] Let's just go.

00:20:57.266 --> 00:20:59.184 line:80%
We'll come back
when the moon's less bright.

00:21:00.436 --> 00:21:01.687 line:80%
Oh! [gasps]

00:21:04.648 --> 00:21:05.816 line:80%
[sighs in relief]

00:21:05.899 --> 00:21:06.900 line:80%
[exclaims]

00:21:06.984 --> 00:21:08.986 line:80%
[♪ fantastical music playing]

00:21:10.195 --> 00:21:11.196 line:80%
[both exclaim]

00:21:12.573 --> 00:21:14.992 line:80%
[both chuckle softly]

00:21:15.075 --> 00:21:16.744 line:80%
[giggles]

00:21:26.545 --> 00:21:27.546 line:80%
[camera shutter clicks]

00:21:28.339 --> 00:21:30.841 line:80%
[Haran exclaims] It's so beautiful.

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:33.761 line:80%
[camera shutter clicks]

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:42.353 line:80%
[camera shutter clicking]

00:21:44.438 --> 00:21:47.358 line:80%
[exhales] I feel like I'm in space.

00:21:48.484 --> 00:21:50.653 line:80%
I feel like I'm in a dream.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:58.661 line:80%
[Chan clears throat]

00:22:08.587 --> 00:22:09.588 line:80%
[Haran chuckles]

00:22:12.174 --> 00:22:13.258 line:80%
But…

00:22:14.551 --> 00:22:17.471 line:80%
those words sounded a bit sad.

00:22:18.973 --> 00:22:21.725 line:80%
The Milky Way being visible
when there's no moon.

00:22:21.809 --> 00:22:23.644 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:22:23.727 --> 00:22:27.481 line:80%
The moon and the Milky Way
go so well together.

00:22:29.024 --> 00:22:34.113 line:80%
It sounds like
they're not meant to be together.

00:22:35.864 --> 00:22:39.034 line:80%
Hmm... That's a bit sad. [chuckles softly]

00:22:40.619 --> 00:22:44.331 line:80%
[sighs deeply]
I feel like I'll never be able

00:22:44.957 --> 00:22:46.834 line:80%
[echoing, muffled]
...to forget this moment.

00:22:46.917 --> 00:22:48.127 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:50.546 line:80%
I've never really liked winter...

00:22:51.171 --> 00:22:52.589 line:80%
[silence]

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:07.271 line:80%
Don't you think so?

00:23:07.354 --> 00:23:09.106 line:80%
-[gasps]
-[♪ melancholic music playing]

00:23:09.189 --> 00:23:10.190 line:80%
Hmm?

00:23:10.274 --> 00:23:11.567 line:80%
You were distracted, weren't you?

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:14.528 line:80%
[chuckles wryly] Sorry.

00:23:14.611 --> 00:23:18.365 line:80%
The stars and the person next to me

00:23:18.449 --> 00:23:19.700 line:80%
were so beautiful

00:23:20.534 --> 00:23:22.703 line:80%
that I spaced out for a moment.

00:23:22.786 --> 00:23:23.829 line:80%
-[chuckles nervously]
-[scoffs]

00:23:23.912 --> 00:23:25.080 line:80%
Gosh.

00:23:26.874 --> 00:23:29.877 line:80%
I said I won't ever forget

00:23:30.627 --> 00:23:32.588 line:80%
this moment.

00:23:34.465 --> 00:23:37.134 line:80%
Ah, and in spring…

00:23:38.135 --> 00:23:40.054 line:80%
Uh, will you not be here in spring?

00:23:43.599 --> 00:23:44.600 line:80%
Anyway,

00:23:45.643 --> 00:23:46.644 line:80%
thank you

00:23:47.519 --> 00:23:49.271 line:80%
for showing me such a beautiful sky.

00:23:52.524 --> 00:23:54.276 line:80%
[exhales]

00:24:04.203 --> 00:24:07.456 line:80%
-[Manjae coughing]
-[♪ music fades]

00:24:08.332 --> 00:24:11.210 line:80%
You're back late. You look tired.

00:24:11.293 --> 00:24:12.503 line:80%
Go and rest.

00:24:12.586 --> 00:24:14.046 line:80%
Goodnight.

00:24:16.548 --> 00:24:18.550 line:80%
[water pouring]

00:24:20.427 --> 00:24:21.428 line:80%
Mr. Park.

00:24:22.471 --> 00:24:23.472 line:80%
Yes?

00:24:24.431 --> 00:24:25.432 line:80%
I…

00:24:27.267 --> 00:24:28.978 line:80%
want to stay by her side

00:24:30.729 --> 00:24:33.440 line:80%
in spring, in summer,

00:24:35.651 --> 00:24:37.069 line:80%
in fall, and in winter.

00:24:37.152 --> 00:24:39.154 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:24:40.781 --> 00:24:42.032 line:80%
I want…

00:24:46.203 --> 00:24:48.247 line:80%
to stay by her side,

00:24:51.291 --> 00:24:53.043 line:80%
but I don't know what to do.

00:25:02.886 --> 00:25:04.054 line:80%
Do you need someone

00:25:05.139 --> 00:25:06.265 line:80%
to talk to?

00:25:10.394 --> 00:25:11.729 line:80%
[sobs]

00:25:14.773 --> 00:25:16.775 line:80%
[♪ emotional music continues]

00:25:26.535 --> 00:25:28.329 line:80%
[Chan] <i>"Surrounded by walls"?</i>

00:25:29.371 --> 00:25:30.998 line:80%
[laptop pinging]

00:25:31.081 --> 00:25:32.458 line:80%
<i>You saved me as well.</i>

00:25:32.541 --> 00:25:34.209 line:80%
<i>Neon alien…</i>

00:25:55.439 --> 00:25:57.650 line:80%
-[♪ emotional music continues]
-[sighs]

00:25:57.733 --> 00:26:03.530 line:80%
SUMMER, SEVEN YEARS AGO
IT STARTED WITH WALLS

00:26:07.993 --> 00:26:09.995 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:26:11.538 --> 00:26:12.873 line:80%
[Hayeong yawns]

00:26:12.956 --> 00:26:15.292 line:80%
I heard you going out late last night.

00:26:15.793 --> 00:26:17.711 line:80%
Were you meeting Chan?

00:26:17.795 --> 00:26:19.338 line:80%
Just for a bit.

00:26:19.421 --> 00:26:23.258 line:80%
Why did you meet at that hour?
Were you making out?

00:26:23.801 --> 00:26:24.843 line:80%
Does it show?

00:26:26.011 --> 00:26:27.721 line:80%
[gasps] Goodness.

00:26:27.805 --> 00:26:29.390 line:80%
No, not at all.

00:26:29.473 --> 00:26:31.016 line:80%
Good job. Make out as much as you want.

00:26:31.100 --> 00:26:32.267 line:80%
[Hayeong gasps]

00:26:32.977 --> 00:26:34.770 line:80%
You're coming downstairs already?

00:26:34.853 --> 00:26:36.647 line:80%
[Haran] Did you not get enough sleep?

00:26:36.730 --> 00:26:39.358 line:80%
I did, I went to bed
at 9:00p.m. last night.

00:26:40.109 --> 00:26:43.529 line:80%
But what's going on here?

00:26:44.321 --> 00:26:47.366 line:80%
Ta-da. We're making you
a lunchbox for your CSAT.

00:26:47.449 --> 00:26:50.869 line:80%
We've been planning the menu
for the past three days.

00:26:50.953 --> 00:26:53.497 line:80%
Will it be safe to eat?

00:26:53.580 --> 00:26:56.000 line:80%
-Of course.
-I can just buy <i>gimbap.</i>

00:26:56.083 --> 00:26:58.293 line:80%
Mom would scold us harshly
if you did that.

00:26:58.377 --> 00:27:00.087 line:80%
Hang on. We just have to heat the soup.

00:27:00.170 --> 00:27:02.172 line:80%
I have to go now, though.

00:27:02.256 --> 00:27:03.465 line:80%
There's plenty of time.

00:27:03.549 --> 00:27:06.051 line:80%
I want to visit Yougyum at the hospital
before I go.

00:27:06.135 --> 00:27:08.262 line:80%
Hospital? Yougyum's in the hospital?

00:27:08.345 --> 00:27:10.889 line:80%
[groans softly]
He told me not to say anything…

00:27:13.559 --> 00:27:16.228 line:80%
He's hospitalized because of his foot.

00:27:16.312 --> 00:27:17.396 line:80%
[Hayeong] Was he hurt badly?

00:27:17.479 --> 00:27:18.981 line:80%
He's a baseball player--

00:27:19.064 --> 00:27:21.358 line:80%
He said he'll get better
with some treatment,

00:27:22.234 --> 00:27:23.235 line:80%
but I'm worried.

00:27:23.319 --> 00:27:24.320 line:80%
[sighs]

00:27:24.862 --> 00:27:27.531 line:80%
Anyway, he's my good luck charm,

00:27:27.614 --> 00:27:30.659 line:80%
so I feel like I should see him
before the CSAT to do well.

00:27:30.743 --> 00:27:32.745 line:80%
Hang on. I'll pack something for him, too.

00:27:33.454 --> 00:27:35.706 line:80%
Hadam, come here for a moment.

00:27:36.457 --> 00:27:39.460 line:80%
Sit down. I'll tie your hair for you.

00:27:40.502 --> 00:27:41.503 line:80%
That's so random.

00:27:41.587 --> 00:27:43.464 line:80%
-[Nana chuckles softly]
-[♪ gentle music playing]

00:27:43.547 --> 00:27:45.174 line:80%
When you have a lot on your mind,

00:27:46.008 --> 00:27:47.968 line:80%
brushing your hair calmly

00:27:48.552 --> 00:27:50.679 line:80%
will help you relax.

00:27:53.974 --> 00:27:56.143 line:80%
Yougyum will get through it,

00:27:56.852 --> 00:28:00.731 line:80%
and don't forget
that you're perfectly prepared.

00:28:06.111 --> 00:28:07.446 line:80%
You look beautiful.

00:28:07.529 --> 00:28:08.530 line:80%
[Hadam chuckles]

00:28:09.239 --> 00:28:11.784 line:80%
Of course. I'm your granddaughter.

00:28:15.371 --> 00:28:16.705 line:80%
Don't worry.

00:28:17.289 --> 00:28:20.834 line:80%
I'm your granddaughter,
and Haran and Hayeong's little sister.

00:28:21.710 --> 00:28:23.420 line:80%
I'll do well.

00:28:23.504 --> 00:28:25.047 line:80%
[Haran] We can take you.

00:28:25.130 --> 00:28:28.384 line:80%
It's really fine.
I want to do this on my own.

00:28:29.760 --> 00:28:31.970 line:80%
Our baby is all grown up
and taking the CSAT.

00:28:32.054 --> 00:28:33.472 line:80%
-[chuckles softly]
-[Hayeong claps] Did you prepare

00:28:33.555 --> 00:28:35.265 line:80%
your OMR marker and a clock?

00:28:35.349 --> 00:28:37.309 line:80%
Markers, clocks, and hand warmers.

00:28:37.393 --> 00:28:40.771 line:80%
You and even Mr. Yeon
gave me a whole heap of them.

00:28:41.355 --> 00:28:44.066 line:80%
She should go now.
Come on, let's give her some strength.

00:28:44.149 --> 00:28:45.150 line:80%
[whines]

00:28:45.234 --> 00:28:47.277 line:80%
[in unison] Strength.

00:28:50.990 --> 00:28:51.991 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:28:52.074 --> 00:28:54.326 line:80%
He said I shouldn't come before the CSAT.

00:28:55.160 --> 00:28:57.079 line:80%
But I have to see him, no matter what.

00:28:58.831 --> 00:29:01.291 line:80%
The surgery is at 8:30 a.m.

00:29:01.375 --> 00:29:04.753 line:80%
and we'll fill the top of the foot
with bone taken from the pelvis.

00:29:05.504 --> 00:29:06.588 line:80%
Surgery?

00:29:09.299 --> 00:29:11.510 line:80%
-You're getting surgery?
-Hadam.

00:29:11.593 --> 00:29:13.053 line:80%
You said it'll get better soon.

00:29:13.137 --> 00:29:15.681 line:80%
Would a bone graft heal in just a week?

00:29:16.181 --> 00:29:18.892 line:80%
I'm sorry. Can I talk to my friend
for just a moment?

00:29:22.187 --> 00:29:24.565 line:80%
It must have hurt so much.

00:29:25.190 --> 00:29:27.985 line:80%
Why didn't you tell me anything?

00:29:28.068 --> 00:29:31.113 line:80%
How could I do that
when you're facing something so important?

00:29:31.905 --> 00:29:33.824 line:80%
I'm okay, so go take the exams.

00:29:33.907 --> 00:29:34.908 line:80%
No,

00:29:35.951 --> 00:29:38.120 line:80%
the most important thing to me is you.

00:29:38.704 --> 00:29:39.830 line:80%
I'm staying by your side.

00:29:40.414 --> 00:29:41.582 line:80%
Hadam.

00:29:41.665 --> 00:29:44.251 line:80%
How can I focus on my exams
when you're getting surgery?

00:29:44.335 --> 00:29:46.754 line:80%
I can enter college a year late.

00:29:47.338 --> 00:29:49.423 line:80%
You can just take the bone from my pelvis.

00:29:49.506 --> 00:29:51.759 line:80%
You play sports, but I just sit and study.

00:29:51.842 --> 00:29:52.885 line:80%
This is why

00:29:53.635 --> 00:29:55.262 line:80%
I couldn't tell you.

00:29:56.263 --> 00:29:58.849 line:80%
If you do this, I can't keep seeing you.

00:29:58.932 --> 00:30:03.145 line:80%
-I can take the CSAT next year.
-[Yougyum] No, that's not okay with me.

00:30:03.729 --> 00:30:04.730 line:80%
I…

00:30:06.357 --> 00:30:08.359 line:80%
want to be able to face you without guilt.

00:30:12.988 --> 00:30:13.989 line:80%
What do we do?

00:30:14.073 --> 00:30:19.870 line:80%
[sobbing] What if you end up
not being able to play baseball?

00:30:21.455 --> 00:30:22.456 line:80%
Hadam.

00:30:23.749 --> 00:30:24.875 line:80%
Give me your hand.

00:30:27.586 --> 00:30:29.880 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:30:29.963 --> 00:30:33.300 line:80%
I'll recover perfectly
and be back on the mound soon.

00:30:33.384 --> 00:30:34.843 line:80%
I'm just taking a short breather.

00:30:35.636 --> 00:30:36.845 line:80%
You saw my room, right?

00:30:36.929 --> 00:30:40.432 line:80%
My life's goal is to be someone
you can be proud of.

00:30:42.309 --> 00:30:43.435 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:30:44.979 --> 00:30:49.024 line:80%
Let's both focus on our own paths
and meet in a few hours.

00:30:49.108 --> 00:30:50.818 line:80%
Come see me after the exams.

00:30:50.901 --> 00:30:52.069 line:80%
You can do that, right?

00:31:01.036 --> 00:31:03.163 line:80%
[teacher]
I'll distribute the exam papers now.

00:31:03.247 --> 00:31:06.333 line:80%
Take one and pass them back.

00:31:25.769 --> 00:31:30.107 line:80%
[Hadam]
<i>Please let Yougyum's surgery go well.</i>

00:31:32.276 --> 00:31:36.322 line:80%
[Yougyum]
<i>Please let Hadam do well on the exam.</i>

00:31:36.405 --> 00:31:38.073 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music continuing]

00:31:39.325 --> 00:31:41.076 line:80%
[teacher] Let's begin the test.

00:31:55.466 --> 00:31:57.760 line:80%
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

00:31:57.843 --> 00:32:00.262 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:32:00.346 --> 00:32:01.472 line:80%
Good morning.

00:32:02.598 --> 00:32:04.183 line:80%
And thank you.

00:32:05.100 --> 00:32:09.271 line:80%
You really are considerate.
You send Hadam a clock and OMR markers.

00:32:09.355 --> 00:32:11.065 line:80%
[snickers, inhales]

00:32:11.148 --> 00:32:12.274 line:80%
What are you doing after work?

00:32:12.358 --> 00:32:14.443 line:80%
I was thinking of getting snacks.

00:32:14.526 --> 00:32:16.153 line:80%
-If you're free…
-[cellphone vibrating]

00:32:16.236 --> 00:32:17.237 line:80%
Ah. Take it.

00:32:22.701 --> 00:32:23.702 line:80%
Yes, Mr. Chae.

00:32:23.786 --> 00:32:25.579 line:80%
[gasps, whispers] It's Mr. Chae?

00:32:26.955 --> 00:32:27.956 line:80%
Just a moment.

00:32:29.625 --> 00:32:34.672 line:80%
The materials company he mentioned
will do a material test in a few weeks.

00:32:34.755 --> 00:32:37.883 line:80%
He wants to visit the factory,
and asked if we'll join.

00:32:37.966 --> 00:32:39.176 line:80%
[excitedly] Of course, we should go.

00:32:39.259 --> 00:32:41.053 line:80%
[exclaims, whispers] That's great.

00:32:41.720 --> 00:32:43.389 line:80%
All right, we'll join you.

00:32:44.139 --> 00:32:45.265 line:80%
Okay.

00:32:45.933 --> 00:32:47.267 line:80%
Uh, and, Hyunwoo,

00:32:48.519 --> 00:32:52.189 line:80%
the chance of Ms. Song and I dating…

00:32:53.023 --> 00:32:54.024 line:80%
is zero.

00:32:54.108 --> 00:32:55.734 line:80%
[♪ melancholic music playing]

00:32:55.818 --> 00:32:57.611 line:80%
I thought I should tell you

00:32:57.695 --> 00:33:00.781 line:80%
that there's no need to worry about that.

00:33:01.740 --> 00:33:02.741 line:80%
Okay.

00:33:03.909 --> 00:33:04.910 line:80%
[line disconnects]

00:33:04.994 --> 00:33:07.913 line:80%
I thought you'd keep waiting
for an answer.

00:33:09.164 --> 00:33:10.582 line:80%
You don't have to waste

00:33:10.666 --> 00:33:12.376 line:80%
-your energy on me.
-[elevator dings]

00:33:18.590 --> 00:33:19.591 line:80%
Aren't you getting in?

00:33:20.676 --> 00:33:23.470 line:80%
I left something at home, no, my car.
[chuckles awkwardly]

00:33:24.263 --> 00:33:25.556 line:80%
All right, then.

00:33:35.899 --> 00:33:36.984 line:80%
Zero…

00:33:38.819 --> 00:33:40.487 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:33:40.571 --> 00:33:41.864 line:80%
You're getting ready?

00:33:42.823 --> 00:33:43.866 line:80%
Yes.

00:33:44.408 --> 00:33:46.118 line:80%
I'll tell her everything

00:33:46.660 --> 00:33:49.079 line:80%
and apologize to her.

00:33:49.538 --> 00:33:50.539 line:80%
<i>At this rate,</i>

00:33:51.332 --> 00:33:53.459 line:80%
<i>I feel like I'll end up hiding more things</i>

00:33:53.542 --> 00:33:56.253 line:80%
<i>and lying to her even more, so I'm scared.</i>

00:33:56.837 --> 00:33:59.882 line:80%
<i>I want to tell her everything</i>

00:33:59.965 --> 00:34:02.760 line:80%
and love her as my true self from now on.

00:34:03.802 --> 00:34:07.139 line:80%
I want to tell her in my own way
before it's too late.

00:34:07.222 --> 00:34:12.311 line:80%
[doctor] The interruption in your hearing
must be from the stress of lying, too.

00:34:12.394 --> 00:34:14.271 line:80%
You know it yourself

00:34:14.355 --> 00:34:16.982 line:80%
that the truth cannot coexist
with false relationships.

00:34:17.650 --> 00:34:21.153 line:80%
[Haran] <i>It sounds like</i>
<i>they're not meant to be together.</i>

00:34:21.236 --> 00:34:23.614 line:80%
[murmurs] Like the Milky Way and the moon…

00:34:24.239 --> 00:34:26.742 line:80%
These symptoms will occur
more frequently and intensely.

00:34:26.825 --> 00:34:28.827 line:80%
It could end up hurting you badly.

00:34:28.911 --> 00:34:31.038 line:80%
Let's stabilize your condition first.

00:34:31.121 --> 00:34:35.167 line:80%
I'll prescribe a short-term
sedative for you. Ah...

00:34:35.250 --> 00:34:37.211 line:80%
What did the new hallucination sound like?

00:34:37.294 --> 00:34:38.295 line:80%
Ah.

00:34:38.379 --> 00:34:40.881 line:80%
<i>It was sharp, like the sound of metal.</i>

00:34:40.964 --> 00:34:43.258 line:80%
And then something…

00:34:44.176 --> 00:34:45.886 line:80%
like this.

00:34:45.969 --> 00:34:47.971 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:34:48.514 --> 00:34:50.933 line:80%
I'm not exactly sure what it was.

00:34:51.016 --> 00:34:52.893 line:80%
But I'm worried that... [inhales sharply]

00:34:52.977 --> 00:34:55.354 line:80%
there's something more behind it.

00:34:55.437 --> 00:34:57.731 line:80%
Like the bracelet sounds?

00:34:57.815 --> 00:35:01.360 line:80%
Yes. And if I want
to tell her about myself,

00:35:01.443 --> 00:35:05.239 line:80%
I think I should fill those gaps
in my memory first.

00:35:05.322 --> 00:35:06.657 line:80%
She's connected...

00:35:08.784 --> 00:35:10.744 line:80%
to what happened seven years ago.

00:35:11.453 --> 00:35:15.874 line:80%
Your memories
are like scattered dots right now.

00:35:15.958 --> 00:35:19.086 line:80%
They're not connected,
so you can't understand them.

00:35:19.169 --> 00:35:22.881 line:80%
But once they start getting connected,

00:35:22.965 --> 00:35:25.175 line:80%
they'll start forming a structure,
like this.

00:35:25.968 --> 00:35:27.636 line:80%
And once the gaps are filled

00:35:27.720 --> 00:35:30.723 line:80%
and you understand them yourself,
you'll be able--

00:35:30.806 --> 00:35:32.016 line:80%
To explain myself

00:35:33.350 --> 00:35:35.561 line:80%
to her better.

00:35:37.271 --> 00:35:41.025 line:80%
Do you think there's a way
to fill those gaps?

00:35:43.110 --> 00:35:44.820 line:80%
Mmm. [inhales sharply]

00:35:45.529 --> 00:35:46.905 line:80%
I think so.

00:35:48.073 --> 00:35:50.576 line:80%
Is there anyone else named Sujin

00:35:50.659 --> 00:35:53.912 line:80%
among the staff besides Lee Sujin?

00:35:53.996 --> 00:35:55.122 line:80%
[receptionist] Just a moment.

00:35:55.706 --> 00:35:56.707 line:80%
[sighs]

00:35:56.790 --> 00:35:58.792 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:36:00.461 --> 00:36:02.254 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music plays]

00:36:09.970 --> 00:36:11.639 line:80%
The day of the accident?

00:36:12.306 --> 00:36:13.682 line:80%
Why are you asking me that?

00:36:15.309 --> 00:36:17.227 line:80%
I heard the explosion seven years ago

00:36:17.311 --> 00:36:20.272 line:80%
in Hyeokchan's lab
was caused by a reagent error.

00:36:21.690 --> 00:36:23.359 line:80%
I was just outside the door at the time.

00:36:24.735 --> 00:36:27.446 line:80%
My memories are hazy from the shock.

00:36:28.572 --> 00:36:29.740 line:80%
Do you remember what happened?

00:36:30.991 --> 00:36:32.910 line:80%
I really want to protect something,

00:36:33.410 --> 00:36:34.411 line:80%
but to do that,

00:36:36.038 --> 00:36:38.791 line:80%
I need my memories.
I came to ask you for help.

00:36:39.583 --> 00:36:41.835 line:80%
I wasn't even a student at your college.

00:36:41.919 --> 00:36:44.004 line:80%
I was just a med student
at a school nearby.

00:36:44.713 --> 00:36:48.467 line:80%
I only visited BIT a few times
to meet Hyeokchan, so why…

00:36:48.550 --> 00:36:50.427 line:80%
Whenever I had glimpses
of my lost memories,

00:36:50.511 --> 00:36:53.013 line:80%
I heard the same sound.

00:36:53.097 --> 00:36:55.015 line:80%
-[high-pitched ringing]
-[bracelet rattling]

00:36:55.099 --> 00:36:56.517 line:80%
[Sujin exclaims]

00:36:56.600 --> 00:36:59.103 line:80%
Hey, Sujin. You're here?
I'll head out now.

00:36:59.186 --> 00:37:00.396 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I heard the sound of your bracelet</i>

00:37:00.479 --> 00:37:03.524 line:80%
<i>that you always wore</i>
<i>when you came to see Hyeokchan.</i>

00:37:04.316 --> 00:37:05.609 line:80%
It seemed like a sign

00:37:05.693 --> 00:37:09.697 line:80%
that you're the person
who remembers everything.

00:37:13.242 --> 00:37:17.037 line:80%
I don't know why the gaps in my memories
are connected to you,

00:37:17.121 --> 00:37:21.291 line:80%
but can you tell me what you know
about what happened

00:37:22.543 --> 00:37:23.669 line:80%
seven years ago that I don't?

00:37:25.170 --> 00:37:27.464 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music continues]

00:37:27.548 --> 00:37:29.174 line:80%
I wrote everything down

00:37:29.842 --> 00:37:31.552 line:80%
whenever I had glimpses of the memories.

00:37:50.321 --> 00:37:52.865 line:80%
-Stop it!
-I'm sorry.

00:37:52.948 --> 00:37:54.575 line:80%
You're in a dangerous state.

00:37:54.658 --> 00:37:56.201 line:80%
-I'm sorry.
-It's not too late.

00:38:00.372 --> 00:38:01.665 line:80%
If there's anything you know…

00:38:01.749 --> 00:38:03.459 line:80%
No, there's nothing.

00:38:04.043 --> 00:38:06.378 line:80%
All I did was exchange
a few words with you.

00:38:06.462 --> 00:38:07.838 line:80%
I'm sorry I couldn't help you.

00:38:08.922 --> 00:38:09.923 line:80%
[Chan] The sound.

00:38:10.966 --> 00:38:13.552 line:80%
Do you know nothing
about the sound I wrote about?

00:38:14.178 --> 00:38:15.721 line:80%
I think it's an important clue.

00:38:15.804 --> 00:38:16.805 line:80%
Uh... [hesitates]

00:38:16.889 --> 00:38:19.642 line:80%
It all started with a sound,
and all these memories--

00:38:19.725 --> 00:38:20.851 line:80%
-[yells] I said I don't know!
-[♪ music fades]

00:38:21.644 --> 00:38:23.687 line:80%
What happened back then still hurts me.

00:38:24.313 --> 00:38:26.190 line:80%
I lost Hyeokchan in that accident.

00:38:26.690 --> 00:38:29.526 line:80%
What's going to change by digging into it?
Someone died.

00:38:30.486 --> 00:38:32.988 line:80%
Why would you torture someone
over just some memories?

00:38:33.072 --> 00:38:35.366 line:80%
You're alive and well right now.

00:38:35.449 --> 00:38:37.701 line:80%
-I…
-I don't know anything,

00:38:38.243 --> 00:38:41.080 line:80%
so don't ever look for me again. [sighs]

00:38:47.878 --> 00:38:49.296 line:80%
[sighs]

00:38:51.048 --> 00:38:53.676 line:80%
Hyeokchan, you left your earphones
in my car…

00:38:56.345 --> 00:38:57.346 line:80%
So you're saying

00:38:58.013 --> 00:39:00.641 line:80%
you kept talking to Haran

00:39:01.433 --> 00:39:02.434 line:80%
while I was away?

00:39:03.018 --> 00:39:04.186 line:80%
Pretending to be me?

00:39:04.269 --> 00:39:05.562 line:80%
[Sujin] Stop it!

00:39:06.438 --> 00:39:08.607 line:80%
[♪ tense music plays]

00:39:16.532 --> 00:39:18.742 line:80%
[♪ music swells, fades]

00:39:18.826 --> 00:39:21.620 line:80%
Genius, won't this look lovely on Chan?

00:39:21.704 --> 00:39:23.163 line:80%
[barks]

00:39:23.247 --> 00:39:25.499 line:80%
[giggling]

00:39:25.582 --> 00:39:26.750 line:80%
You're so cute.

00:39:27.376 --> 00:39:29.086 line:80%
[gasps, chuckles softly]

00:39:32.381 --> 00:39:33.382 line:80%
[gasps]

00:39:34.008 --> 00:39:35.342 line:80%
Where were you?

00:39:35.426 --> 00:39:37.636 line:80%
I didn't call in case you were
having a meeting with Ben.

00:39:43.767 --> 00:39:46.228 line:80%
Hey, why don't you look happy to see me?

00:39:48.647 --> 00:39:52.526 line:80%
I am. I'm so happy, I almost danced.

00:39:53.527 --> 00:39:54.903 line:80%
Is something wrong?

00:39:54.987 --> 00:39:55.988 line:80%
You look troubled.

00:39:59.658 --> 00:40:02.828 line:80%
[Chan groans softly]
I was, because I missed you.

00:40:03.454 --> 00:40:04.621 line:80%
But I came here,

00:40:05.122 --> 00:40:07.833 line:80%
and you're right in front of me.

00:40:08.834 --> 00:40:10.794 line:80%
Then look at me all you want.

00:40:13.505 --> 00:40:15.507 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:40:20.054 --> 00:40:22.556 line:80%
Oh. Why aren't you sitting
in your usual seat?

00:40:22.640 --> 00:40:25.601 line:80%
[Haran] You weren't here,
so I was waiting to see you coming.

00:40:25.684 --> 00:40:27.394 line:80%
-Like a meerkat.
-[Chan chuckles]

00:40:27.978 --> 00:40:29.438 line:80%
What did you sketch? Can I see?

00:40:29.521 --> 00:40:30.689 line:80%
[exclaiming]

00:40:30.773 --> 00:40:32.483 line:80%
[stammering] No, this…

00:40:32.566 --> 00:40:34.109 line:80%
It's a trade secret.

00:40:34.193 --> 00:40:36.070 line:80%
-[chuckles awkwardly]
-[Manjae muttering]

00:40:37.529 --> 00:40:40.115 line:80%
-[exclaims] Let me take those.
-[Manjae exclaiming]

00:40:40.199 --> 00:40:43.077 line:80%
Customers have been asking for blankets,

00:40:43.160 --> 00:40:46.038 line:80%
so I washed them. [chuckles]

00:40:46.121 --> 00:40:47.623 line:80%
You should ask me to do chores.

00:40:47.706 --> 00:40:49.667 line:80%
I should put these in the baskets, right?

00:40:49.750 --> 00:40:52.503 line:80%
-Yes. Thank you.
-No problem.

00:40:52.586 --> 00:40:54.129 line:80%
-[cellphone vibrates]
-Hmm?

00:40:54.755 --> 00:40:55.881 line:80%
[Seok] <i>Happy birthday.</i>

00:40:55.964 --> 00:40:59.134 line:80%
<i>I'm flying out for a seminar,</i>
<i>so I wanted to say it a day early.</i>

00:40:59.218 --> 00:41:01.053 line:80%
<i>I'll treat you for the watch soon.</i>

00:41:01.136 --> 00:41:02.137 line:80%
Birthday?

00:41:03.806 --> 00:41:05.057 line:80%
I should make this soon.

00:41:06.642 --> 00:41:08.102 line:80%
SHIM
Coffee House

00:41:08.894 --> 00:41:10.771 line:80%
Keep your schedule cleared
tomorrow evening.

00:41:10.854 --> 00:41:12.940 line:80%
We're going to dress up
and have a nice dinner.

00:41:13.023 --> 00:41:14.233 line:80%
Sounds good.

00:41:14.316 --> 00:41:15.693 line:80%
Uh, but why all of a sudden?

00:41:16.443 --> 00:41:19.905 line:80%
Uh... I added dressing up

00:41:19.989 --> 00:41:22.408 line:80%
and having a fancy dinner
to the bucket list.

00:41:22.491 --> 00:41:24.118 line:80%
I'll treat you to everything,

00:41:24.201 --> 00:41:25.661 line:80%
and tell you the location later.

00:41:25.744 --> 00:41:26.787 line:80%
Hmm...

00:41:26.870 --> 00:41:30.124 line:80%
-What's going on?
-Anyway, dress up, okay? See you.

00:41:32.001 --> 00:41:33.460 line:80%
[groans] <i>His size…</i>

00:41:34.795 --> 00:41:36.046 line:80%
[giggles]

00:41:38.632 --> 00:41:39.633 line:80%
This is out of the blue.

00:41:43.178 --> 00:41:44.179 line:80%
Uh...

00:41:44.263 --> 00:41:47.683 line:80%
I have a habit of saying goodbye
the American way.

00:41:49.184 --> 00:41:51.103 line:80%
-Since when?
-Starting today.

00:41:51.186 --> 00:41:52.229 line:80%
[Haran giggles]

00:41:52.313 --> 00:41:53.397 line:80%
I'll get going now.

00:41:57.735 --> 00:41:59.194 line:80%
Hmm? [clears throat]

00:42:01.822 --> 00:42:04.366 line:80%
FATHER
HAPPY BIRTHDAY

00:42:08.871 --> 00:42:09.872 line:80%
Gosh.

00:42:10.456 --> 00:42:11.874 line:80%
That was way too obvious.

00:42:12.833 --> 00:42:13.876 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:42:13.959 --> 00:42:17.713 line:80%
[doctor] <i>Do you think there's a way</i>
<i>to fill those gaps?</i>

00:42:20.007 --> 00:42:22.009 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[sighs]

00:42:35.314 --> 00:42:37.441 line:80%
-[Yougyum weakly] Hadam.
-Yougyum.

00:42:37.524 --> 00:42:39.485 line:80%
How did you do?

00:42:41.195 --> 00:42:42.863 line:80%
I nailed it.

00:42:43.781 --> 00:42:44.907 line:80%
I kept my promise.

00:42:45.658 --> 00:42:46.825 line:80%
I'm glad.

00:42:47.993 --> 00:42:50.120 line:80%
[breathing shakily] I'm so glad.

00:42:50.663 --> 00:42:51.664 line:80%
Thank you.

00:42:51.747 --> 00:42:53.707 line:80%
They said the surgery went well.

00:42:53.791 --> 00:42:55.376 line:80%
You did it.

00:42:55.959 --> 00:42:58.587 line:80%
I keep feeling sleepy.

00:42:58.671 --> 00:42:59.672 line:80%
Okay.

00:43:01.006 --> 00:43:02.716 line:80%
Sleep. I'll stay with you.

00:43:03.258 --> 00:43:05.386 line:80%
[♪ gentle music plays]

00:43:06.512 --> 00:43:09.807 line:80%
[Yougyum] <i>I'll recover perfectly</i>
<i>and be back on the mound soon.</i>

00:43:22.277 --> 00:43:24.279 line:80%
-[Hadam sniffles]
-[♪ music fades]

00:43:26.198 --> 00:43:28.742 line:80%
Oh, Mr. Yeon, we're heading out now.

00:43:28.826 --> 00:43:30.744 line:80%
See you tomorrow.

00:43:31.412 --> 00:43:33.497 line:80%
-See you tomorrow.
-You're working late again?

00:43:33.580 --> 00:43:34.748 line:80%
Hang in there.

00:43:35.541 --> 00:43:38.085 line:80%
[Raemee] I want to be on Hayeong's team!

00:43:38.168 --> 00:43:39.670 line:80%
-Me too.
-[Seunggyu] Me too, me too.

00:43:39.753 --> 00:43:40.754 line:80%
Me too!

00:43:40.838 --> 00:43:42.840 line:80%
[Hayeong] You all want to pair up with me,
the bowling genius.

00:43:42.923 --> 00:43:43.924 line:80%
[cellphone vibrates]

00:43:45.175 --> 00:43:46.468 line:80%
Yes, Ms. Kim.

00:43:46.552 --> 00:43:49.805 line:80%
[Nana] <i>You postponed the meeting</i>
<i>with Most Korea's editor-in-chief, right?</i>

00:43:49.888 --> 00:43:52.266 line:80%
Yes, I postponed it to next week.

00:43:53.434 --> 00:43:57.187 line:80%
Sorry, but could I ask
where you're going tomorrow?

00:43:57.771 --> 00:43:59.106 line:80%
<i>-I should know</i>
-I'm here…

00:43:59.189 --> 00:44:01.066 line:80%
<i>-to feel more at ease.</i>
-[Nana] Chuncheon.

00:44:01.650 --> 00:44:03.027 line:80%
I'm visiting my hometown.

00:44:03.110 --> 00:44:05.946 line:80%
Don't worry, and call me
if anything urgent comes up.

00:44:06.030 --> 00:44:07.114 line:80%
All right.

00:44:07.197 --> 00:44:08.198 line:80%
You're here.

00:44:08.282 --> 00:44:10.284 line:80%
You cleared your schedule
to go to Chuncheon?

00:44:10.367 --> 00:44:11.368 line:80%
Why Chuncheon?

00:44:11.452 --> 00:44:12.870 line:80%
I want to have some fun, too.

00:44:14.330 --> 00:44:17.374 line:80%
I want to visit
our old neighborhood with Manjae.

00:44:17.958 --> 00:44:19.126 line:80%
I see.

00:44:20.294 --> 00:44:21.879 line:80%
What do you mean, "I see"?

00:44:23.172 --> 00:44:24.256 line:80%
It's nothing. [chuckles]

00:44:24.340 --> 00:44:26.175 line:80%
And you look good in all the scarves.

00:44:26.258 --> 00:44:27.968 line:80%
Your beauty can pull off any color.

00:44:28.469 --> 00:44:30.596 line:80%
But I like the one on the left.

00:44:31.472 --> 00:44:33.307 line:80%
Keep smiling like that. You look pretty.

00:44:34.266 --> 00:44:36.560 line:80%
It's rare to find someone
who makes you smile. Hold onto him.

00:44:44.902 --> 00:44:47.321 line:80%
[inhales sharply] She has great taste.

00:44:48.656 --> 00:44:49.865 line:80%
She really takes after me.

00:44:49.948 --> 00:44:51.659 line:80%
[♪ lively music playing]

00:44:54.078 --> 00:44:55.663 line:80%
Look at this.

00:44:56.372 --> 00:44:58.540 line:80%
All right. Is this better?

00:45:00.501 --> 00:45:02.044 line:80%
-[Manjae scoffs]
-[Genius whines]

00:45:02.127 --> 00:45:04.546 line:80%
-[Manjae] Or this?
-[automated voice] <i>I love you.</i>

00:45:04.630 --> 00:45:08.384 line:80%
[laughs] I know. I love you, too.

00:45:08.467 --> 00:45:11.428 line:80%
But I have to choose
which scarf to wear right now.

00:45:11.512 --> 00:45:13.597 line:80%
Look at them again. Which is better?

00:45:13.681 --> 00:45:17.643 line:80%
[on PA] <i>This train will soon arrive</i>
<i>at its final stop, Chuncheon Station.</i>

00:45:21.730 --> 00:45:23.482 line:80%
Everything's changed.

00:45:24.274 --> 00:45:25.859 line:80%
I can't tell which is which.

00:45:25.943 --> 00:45:26.944 line:80%
[Manjae inhales sharply]

00:45:27.903 --> 00:45:31.865 line:80%
I think… this is where your house was.

00:45:32.825 --> 00:45:35.244 line:80%
Yes, you're right.

00:45:36.954 --> 00:45:38.038 line:80%
But…

00:45:38.872 --> 00:45:40.290 line:80%
our house is gone.

00:45:41.250 --> 00:45:42.584 line:80%
[chuckling] Gosh.

00:45:42.668 --> 00:45:44.420 line:80%
It's been so many years.

00:45:45.754 --> 00:45:46.755 line:80%
[clicks tongue]

00:45:46.839 --> 00:45:51.176 line:80%
Right. Even we've changed this much,
so they can't possibly still be here.

00:45:51.260 --> 00:45:53.345 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:45:53.429 --> 00:45:54.430 line:80%
It's here!

00:45:55.389 --> 00:45:56.515 line:80%
The tree's still here.

00:45:59.393 --> 00:46:01.937 line:80%
[Nana] You're right, it's still here.

00:46:02.021 --> 00:46:04.398 line:80%
The persimmon tree my dad planted.

00:46:05.274 --> 00:46:06.275 line:80%
[sighs in relief]

00:46:06.942 --> 00:46:08.152 line:80%
I'm glad

00:46:09.361 --> 00:46:10.779 line:80%
that's still here, at least.

00:46:13.574 --> 00:46:14.992 line:80%
[bell ringing]

00:46:15.743 --> 00:46:18.078 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:46:18.162 --> 00:46:19.538 line:80%
[tires screeching]

00:46:19.621 --> 00:46:22.207 line:80%
Nabong, let's go to school!

00:46:24.043 --> 00:46:26.170 line:80%
I'm going to school!

00:46:26.253 --> 00:46:27.379 line:80%
Manjae! [chuckles]

00:46:31.175 --> 00:46:33.427 line:80%
-All right. Let's go.
-Hold on tight.

00:46:34.553 --> 00:46:36.555 line:80%
[young Nana humming "La Vie En Rose"]

00:46:38.682 --> 00:46:40.809 line:80%
[Nana continues humming "La Vie En Rose"]

00:46:42.853 --> 00:46:44.063 line:80%
-Wow…
-[chuckles]

00:46:44.146 --> 00:46:46.774 line:80%
[laughs boisterously] It's right here.

00:46:46.857 --> 00:46:48.609 line:80%
[Nana] This tree is still here.

00:46:49.109 --> 00:46:50.277 line:80%
[Manjae] It hasn't changed at all.

00:46:50.361 --> 00:46:52.529 line:80%
-[Nana] Come on. Hurry.
-[Manjae exclaiming]

00:46:52.613 --> 00:46:53.781 line:80%
[both laughing]

00:46:53.864 --> 00:46:55.157 line:80%
Right.

00:46:55.240 --> 00:46:57.868 line:80%
-[digital beeping]
-[exclaims]

00:47:05.459 --> 00:47:06.502 line:80%
[camera clicks]

00:47:08.754 --> 00:47:09.838 line:80%
This is so nice.

00:47:09.922 --> 00:47:10.964 line:80%
[both giggle]

00:47:11.048 --> 00:47:14.051 line:80%
Hmm... Hang on, it's untied.

00:47:14.760 --> 00:47:15.761 line:80%
Mmm...

00:47:19.515 --> 00:47:20.516 line:80%
[Nana chuckles]

00:47:21.266 --> 00:47:23.185 line:80%
Ah... [groans] Have some water.

00:47:23.936 --> 00:47:26.021 line:80%
-Manjae, there's something in here.
-Huh?

00:47:27.022 --> 00:47:29.900 line:80%
-[Manjae exclaims]
-[Nana laughs]

00:47:29.984 --> 00:47:32.695 line:80%
I got you! [laughing]

00:47:33.278 --> 00:47:36.198 line:80%
Try and catch me. [giggling]

00:47:36.281 --> 00:47:38.283 line:80%
[birds chirping]

00:47:39.493 --> 00:47:41.370 line:80%
[sighs, sniffles]

00:47:47.501 --> 00:47:49.795 line:80%
-[Manjae laughing]
-[Nana exclaims]

00:47:49.878 --> 00:47:51.338 line:80%
Manjae! My goodness.

00:47:51.422 --> 00:47:54.550 line:80%
-I got my revenge.
-Unbelievable.

00:47:54.633 --> 00:47:57.011 line:80%
[both laughing]

00:47:57.094 --> 00:47:58.512 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:47:58.595 --> 00:48:00.931 line:80%
Stay here. I'll go get something warm.

00:48:01.015 --> 00:48:02.099 line:80%
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:48:04.393 --> 00:48:05.561 line:80%
[wind whooshing]

00:48:06.520 --> 00:48:07.521 line:80%
[sighs]

00:48:18.991 --> 00:48:20.993 line:80%
[♪ tense music plays]

00:48:31.462 --> 00:48:33.547 line:80%
[cellphone ringing]

00:48:38.552 --> 00:48:39.553 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:48:39.636 --> 00:48:42.973 line:80%
I must've startled you yesterday.
It was the anesthetics.

00:48:43.057 --> 00:48:45.726 line:80%
[inhales sharply] I'm completely fine now.

00:48:45.809 --> 00:48:47.936 line:80%
No, it's the painkillers.

00:48:48.020 --> 00:48:50.939 line:80%
The second day of the bone graft
hurts the most.

00:48:51.023 --> 00:48:53.734 line:80%
The pain in your pelvis
will probably get worse tomorrow,

00:48:53.817 --> 00:48:56.195 line:80%
and you'll barely be able to walk
with crutches

00:48:56.278 --> 00:48:58.322 line:80%
after the drain is removed
on the third day.

00:48:58.405 --> 00:48:59.531 line:80%
-And--
-Wait.

00:49:00.115 --> 00:49:03.744 line:80%
Did I wake after 10 years of sleep
or something?

00:49:04.328 --> 00:49:05.704 line:80%
Did you become a doctor already?

00:49:05.788 --> 00:49:08.499 line:80%
I studied about bone grafting all night.

00:49:08.582 --> 00:49:10.250 line:80%
And here's your plan.

00:49:11.251 --> 00:49:12.252 line:80%
What plan?

00:49:13.420 --> 00:49:17.341 line:80%
A 12-week plan to pass
the New York Comets' physical.

00:49:17.800 --> 00:49:20.177 line:80%
I'm going to help you
with your rehabilitation now.

00:49:20.260 --> 00:49:21.261 line:80%
Huh?

00:49:21.345 --> 00:49:24.473 line:80%
I did well on the CSAT,
and I have time on my hands.

00:49:24.974 --> 00:49:27.267 line:80%
The first step is the hospital treatment.

00:49:27.768 --> 00:49:28.894 line:80%
Focus on recovering,

00:49:28.978 --> 00:49:31.855 line:80%
and once you can move, it's step two.

00:49:31.939 --> 00:49:33.148 line:80%
You'd better brace yourself.

00:49:33.649 --> 00:49:35.359 line:80%
I signed up for the study room again.

00:49:35.442 --> 00:49:37.987 line:80%
I guess I'm getting practice
as a future medical professional.

00:49:40.030 --> 00:49:41.031 line:80%
[yells] Yougyum!

00:49:41.115 --> 00:49:42.616 line:80%
[sobbing] Hey!

00:49:44.326 --> 00:49:47.579 line:80%
Why didn't you tell me
you were getting surgery?

00:49:47.663 --> 00:49:51.000 line:80%
Should I give you some time alone?

00:49:51.083 --> 00:49:53.377 line:80%
-Hey, I'm getting a call.
-[cellphone vibrating]

00:49:53.460 --> 00:49:54.461 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:49:57.172 --> 00:49:58.173 line:80%
Hello?

00:49:58.257 --> 00:50:01.510 line:80%
[woman] <i>Hi, I saw this number</i>
<i>on this woman's necklace.</i>

00:50:01.593 --> 00:50:04.847 line:80%
<i>She doesn't seem to know</i>
<i>where she is right now.</i>

00:50:04.930 --> 00:50:07.433 line:80%
<i>I thought I should let you know.</i>

00:50:07.516 --> 00:50:09.226 line:80%
Uh, right. Just a moment.

00:50:09.310 --> 00:50:11.645 line:80%
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:50:12.438 --> 00:50:13.689 line:80%
Can you buy me some tangerines?

00:50:13.772 --> 00:50:17.860 line:80%
I'm suddenly craving them.
Maybe I need vitamins.

00:50:17.943 --> 00:50:19.111 line:80%
Sure, I'll go buy some.

00:50:19.194 --> 00:50:21.655 line:80%
Yang Changmo, come with me.

00:50:21.739 --> 00:50:23.657 line:80%
I shouldn't leave you with him.

00:50:23.741 --> 00:50:26.869 line:80%
Call me if you need anything else.
I'll get it for you.

00:50:29.747 --> 00:50:31.206 line:80%
Where are you calling from?

00:50:33.125 --> 00:50:34.376 line:80%
Chuncheon?

00:50:34.460 --> 00:50:36.378 line:80%
-[groans]
-[♪ music swells]

00:50:36.462 --> 00:50:40.299 line:80%
Can you stay with her for a moment?
I'll call you back soon.

00:50:40.382 --> 00:50:43.510 line:80%
Have you seen someone like this
on the way here?

00:50:43.594 --> 00:50:46.639 line:80%
You didn't? All right, thank you.

00:50:47.640 --> 00:50:49.892 line:80%
[cellphone ringing]

00:50:51.310 --> 00:50:53.395 line:80%
-Hello?
<i>-Is this Hadam's grandmother's phone?</i>

00:50:53.479 --> 00:50:56.106 line:80%
Are you with Ms. Nana Kim right now?

00:50:56.190 --> 00:50:57.983 line:80%
I'm her youngest
granddaughter's boyfriend.

00:50:58.067 --> 00:50:59.068 line:80%
She was lost,

00:50:59.151 --> 00:51:01.528 line:80%
<i>so someone called and said she's with her.</i>

00:51:02.237 --> 00:51:03.405 line:80%
What?

00:51:05.115 --> 00:51:07.701 line:80%
[Yougyum]
<i>I'm the only one who knows her condition.</i>

00:51:08.243 --> 00:51:10.788 line:80%
<i>Hadam and her sisters don't know yet.</i>

00:51:10.871 --> 00:51:12.956 line:80%
-Hello.
-I called you earlier…

00:51:13.040 --> 00:51:14.750 line:80%
[woman] Ah. Over there.

00:51:16.794 --> 00:51:19.254 line:80%
Ah, yes, thank you.

00:51:19.338 --> 00:51:21.840 line:80%
-[Nana humming]
-[Manjae sighs in relief]

00:51:25.302 --> 00:51:26.303 line:80%
Nabong.

00:51:27.846 --> 00:51:29.139 line:80%
[♪ melancholic music playing]

00:51:33.727 --> 00:51:35.062 line:80%
[nurse] <i>Ms. Kim Nabong!</i>

00:51:35.145 --> 00:51:36.605 line:80%
-Ms. Kim Nabong!
-[Manjae] Wait, Na…

00:51:36.689 --> 00:51:38.357 line:80%
[Nana] <i>I was just visiting a friend there.</i>

00:51:39.108 --> 00:51:40.442 line:80%
<i>I'm going to France soon.</i>

00:51:43.988 --> 00:51:45.114 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>That's what it was.</i>

00:51:46.240 --> 00:51:48.367 line:80%
This is what was happening

00:51:49.284 --> 00:51:50.369 line:80%
to you.

00:51:50.452 --> 00:51:52.454 line:80%
[Nana continues humming]

00:51:56.834 --> 00:51:59.003 line:80%
Nabong, come back to me.

00:51:59.503 --> 00:52:00.671 line:80%
Huh?

00:52:00.754 --> 00:52:01.797 line:80%
It's me,

00:52:02.506 --> 00:52:03.549 line:80%
it's Manjae.

00:52:04.341 --> 00:52:05.926 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:52:06.010 --> 00:52:07.136 line:80%
I'm tired.

00:52:08.429 --> 00:52:10.055 line:80%
I'm so tired.

00:52:10.139 --> 00:52:11.640 line:80%
Okay, get some rest.

00:52:11.724 --> 00:52:13.600 line:80%
Keep resting.

00:52:14.310 --> 00:52:15.394 line:80%
Just rest.

00:52:22.109 --> 00:52:24.111 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:52:34.163 --> 00:52:36.165 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:52:37.666 --> 00:52:40.544 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I booked a table here.</i>
<i>Come by 8:00 p.m.</i>

00:52:41.462 --> 00:52:42.671 line:80%
Hmm...

00:52:43.380 --> 00:52:45.507 line:80%
[inhales sharply, exhales] Hmm...

00:52:45.591 --> 00:52:47.801 line:80%
[Haran] <i>You always look nice,</i>
<i>but dress even nicer.</i>

00:52:47.885 --> 00:52:49.470 line:80%
[chuckles softly] This is it.

00:52:51.972 --> 00:52:54.141 line:80%
[doctor] <i>You know it yourself</i>

00:52:54.224 --> 00:52:57.019 line:80%
<i>that the truth cannot coexist</i>
<i>with false relationships.</i>

00:52:58.812 --> 00:52:59.855 line:80%
[sighs]

00:53:01.357 --> 00:53:02.608 line:80%
It's my friend's birthday.

00:53:02.691 --> 00:53:05.653 line:80%
Can you bring that with the candles lit
for the dessert course?

00:53:05.736 --> 00:53:07.571 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:53:07.655 --> 00:53:08.697 line:80%
[Hayeong] This much?

00:53:15.579 --> 00:53:18.040 line:80%
Gosh, why does it keep falling?

00:53:20.084 --> 00:53:22.419 line:80%
[creaking]

00:53:23.837 --> 00:53:24.838 line:80%
[snaps]

00:53:26.632 --> 00:53:27.758 line:80%
[exclaims]

00:53:27.841 --> 00:53:30.678 line:80%
[♪ heart-fluttering music playing]

00:53:43.107 --> 00:53:44.149 line:80%
[Taeseok] Your hand.

00:53:44.233 --> 00:53:45.651 line:80%
Are you okay?

00:53:45.734 --> 00:53:48.028 line:80%
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:53:49.321 --> 00:53:50.614 line:80%
I'm fine.

00:53:51.699 --> 00:53:52.700 line:80%
[sighs in relief]

00:53:54.326 --> 00:53:55.869 line:80%
That's a relief.

00:53:57.997 --> 00:53:59.832 line:80%
Ah. Are you okay?

00:54:00.416 --> 00:54:01.417 line:80%
Yes...

00:54:05.421 --> 00:54:06.422 line:80%
I'm fine.

00:54:11.010 --> 00:54:12.928 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:54:13.012 --> 00:54:15.639 line:80%
I'll clean up here. You should go.

00:54:16.307 --> 00:54:19.059 line:80%
Don't work so late like you did yesterday.

00:54:34.992 --> 00:54:36.493 line:80%
Let's talk for a moment.

00:54:37.953 --> 00:54:39.955 line:80%
[♪ gentle music playing]

00:54:49.715 --> 00:54:51.800 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'll be there in five minutes.</i>
<i>See you soon.</i>

00:54:54.720 --> 00:54:55.971 line:80%
[metallic clink]

00:55:02.645 --> 00:55:04.396 line:80%
-[metallic clink echoes]
-[♪ music stops]

00:55:07.441 --> 00:55:08.651 line:80%
[lighter clicking]

00:55:12.154 --> 00:55:13.906 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:55:14.490 --> 00:55:15.741 line:80%
[static]

00:55:21.121 --> 00:55:22.790 line:80%
[lighter continues clicking]

00:55:28.087 --> 00:55:30.756 line:80%
I'm sorry, but that sound is bothering me.

00:55:33.258 --> 00:55:34.259 line:80%
Sorry.

00:55:35.219 --> 00:55:38.055 line:80%
[lighter continues clicking]

00:55:44.770 --> 00:55:46.563 line:80%
[doctor]
<i>It could end up hurting you badly.</i>

00:55:46.647 --> 00:55:47.648 line:80%
[Haran] <i>And in spring…</i>

00:55:47.731 --> 00:55:50.442 line:80%
<i>It sounds like</i>
<i>they're not meant to be together.</i>

00:55:50.526 --> 00:55:51.527 line:80%
[Sujin] I don't know anything.

00:55:51.610 --> 00:55:54.196 line:80%
[Haran] <i>You always look nice,</i>
<i>but dress even nicer.</i>

00:56:02.371 --> 00:56:04.373 line:80%
[♪ music intensifies]

00:56:08.627 --> 00:56:09.628 line:80%
[groans]

00:56:21.724 --> 00:56:22.725 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:56:26.312 --> 00:56:29.189 line:80%
I feel like I should hear
your honest thoughts

00:56:30.065 --> 00:56:31.817 line:80%
to be able to move on.

00:56:33.694 --> 00:56:35.529 line:80%
I have a meeting tomorrow morning.

00:56:35.612 --> 00:56:37.740 line:80%
I have some more work to do--

00:56:37.823 --> 00:56:39.450 line:80%
Just have one glass.

00:56:39.533 --> 00:56:40.784 line:80%
This could be

00:56:41.410 --> 00:56:42.828 line:80%
the last time we talk like this.

00:56:54.048 --> 00:56:57.843 line:80%
How did you know
I've been working late these days?

00:56:57.926 --> 00:57:01.013 line:80%
I don't head out until all the lights
are turned off in the office.

00:57:01.096 --> 00:57:03.515 line:80%
Then what about how you stopped the shelf…

00:57:03.599 --> 00:57:06.060 line:80%
A designer's hands
are their greatest asset.

00:57:06.143 --> 00:57:09.396 line:80%
I only did that to stop you
from getting hurt.

00:57:09.480 --> 00:57:12.274 line:80%
Because I'm a designer at the atelier?

00:57:15.069 --> 00:57:16.070 line:80%
Not because…

00:57:16.153 --> 00:57:17.863 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:57:17.946 --> 00:57:19.990 line:80%
I'm Song Hayeong?

00:57:26.538 --> 00:57:27.539 line:80%
No.

00:57:32.169 --> 00:57:33.629 line:80%
[Hayeong exhales]

00:57:35.589 --> 00:57:36.882 line:80%
But, Mr. Yeon,

00:57:36.965 --> 00:57:38.300 line:80%
I…

00:57:39.134 --> 00:57:40.969 line:80%
keep misunderstanding such gestures.

00:57:42.471 --> 00:57:44.807 line:80%
You got revenge on Cha Min for me,

00:57:45.307 --> 00:57:47.309 line:80%
brushed off those leaves with your hands,

00:57:50.270 --> 00:57:53.482 line:80%
and told me it's okay to say I'm not okay.

00:57:55.901 --> 00:57:58.404 line:80%
I keep replaying those moments in my head.

00:57:59.279 --> 00:58:01.323 line:80%
So I have to hear it today.

00:58:01.407 --> 00:58:04.743 line:80%
This will keep going on
if I don't hear an honest answer.

00:58:06.286 --> 00:58:08.872 line:80%
Am I really…

00:58:09.915 --> 00:58:11.625 line:80%
just mistaken

00:58:12.876 --> 00:58:14.336 line:80%
about all those situations?

00:58:16.922 --> 00:58:18.215 line:80%
Ms. Kim

00:58:19.133 --> 00:58:20.759 line:80%
is my savior.

00:58:21.635 --> 00:58:24.138 line:80%
And her family, Haran, you,

00:58:24.972 --> 00:58:26.056 line:80%
and Hadam,

00:58:26.140 --> 00:58:27.975 line:80%
are precious to me, too.

00:58:29.393 --> 00:58:30.936 line:80%
I have to protect all of you.

00:58:32.396 --> 00:58:34.356 line:80%
That's why I took care of you.

00:58:34.440 --> 00:58:37.192 line:80%
Even if Haran was in danger,

00:58:37.985 --> 00:58:39.236 line:80%
I would've done the same.

00:58:40.612 --> 00:58:42.698 line:80%
If those moments gave you the wrong idea,

00:58:43.991 --> 00:58:44.992 line:80%
then I'm sorry.

00:58:48.620 --> 00:58:51.832 line:80%
So I guess you're saying

00:58:52.750 --> 00:58:56.462 line:80%
you don't see me as a woman at all.

00:58:58.464 --> 00:58:59.465 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:59:01.091 --> 00:59:04.845 line:80%
Okay. If you're that firm about it,
then there's nothing I can do.

00:59:05.429 --> 00:59:07.348 line:80%
I don't want to cause you trouble.

00:59:07.431 --> 00:59:11.143 line:80%
I can easily move on and let this go.

00:59:11.226 --> 00:59:12.227 line:80%
Easily.

00:59:12.311 --> 00:59:14.104 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:59:15.147 --> 00:59:16.231 line:80%
How about a handshake?

00:59:17.149 --> 00:59:20.402 line:80%
Uh, it would be stupid
for us to grow awkward because of this.

00:59:20.486 --> 00:59:23.447 line:80%
So let's shake hands to end this

00:59:23.530 --> 00:59:24.823 line:80%
on good terms.

00:59:34.750 --> 00:59:36.043 line:80%
[inhales]

00:59:36.126 --> 00:59:39.254 line:80%
[exclaims graciously] You can go now.
You said you have a meeting.

00:59:40.631 --> 00:59:42.424 line:80%
I'm going to eat some of this.

00:59:42.508 --> 00:59:44.718 line:80%
My stomach's been growling for a while.

00:59:47.721 --> 00:59:48.931 line:80%
[driver] I'll start the car now.

00:59:51.350 --> 00:59:52.768 line:80%
Excuse me. Sir?

00:59:54.353 --> 00:59:55.521 line:80%
Oh...

00:59:55.604 --> 00:59:57.648 line:80%
Yes, please go.

01:00:06.907 --> 01:00:07.908 line:80%
Sir.

01:00:08.742 --> 01:00:11.203 line:80%
Sorry, but can you open the trunk?

01:00:17.376 --> 01:00:18.377 line:80%
[sniffles]

01:00:18.460 --> 01:00:20.462 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

01:00:24.383 --> 01:00:26.385 line:80%
[breathes heavily]

01:00:34.977 --> 01:00:36.895 line:80%
[whimpers]

01:00:38.022 --> 01:00:39.440 line:80%
[sobbing]

01:00:47.865 --> 01:00:50.743 line:80%
[inhales sharply, crying]

01:01:05.716 --> 01:01:08.510 line:80%
[nurse] How did you hold out
with a fever close to 40 degrees?

01:01:08.594 --> 01:01:11.096 line:80%
Once the meds kick in,
your fever should come down.

01:01:11.180 --> 01:01:12.264 line:80%
Get some rest.

01:01:12.348 --> 01:01:13.349 line:80%
[young Taeseok] Thank you.

01:01:14.308 --> 01:01:15.559 line:80%
<i>I'm sorry, Ms. Kim.</i>

01:01:15.643 --> 01:01:18.020 line:80%
<i>I should've driven you on your trip,</i>

01:01:18.103 --> 01:01:20.105 line:80%
<i>but I shouldn't drive in this state.</i>

01:01:20.189 --> 01:01:23.359 line:80%
<i>I'll get better soon</i>
<i>and pick you up once your trip's over.</i>

01:01:23.859 --> 01:01:24.985 line:80%
<i>I'm so sorry.</i>

01:01:25.069 --> 01:01:26.320 line:80%
[cellphone vibrates]

01:01:26.862 --> 01:01:27.905 line:80%
[groans]

01:01:30.282 --> 01:01:32.576 line:80%
DAUGHTER OF KIM NABONG
AND HER HUSBAND HAVE PASSED AWAY

01:01:37.623 --> 01:01:38.624 line:80%
Sorry.

01:01:40.209 --> 01:01:41.960 line:80%
[young Hayeong] I have to be okay.

01:01:42.044 --> 01:01:43.712 line:80%
I have to keep our family together.

01:01:43.796 --> 01:01:45.130 line:80%
[sighs]

01:01:45.214 --> 01:01:46.423 line:80%
I have to be okay.

01:01:47.174 --> 01:01:48.509 line:80%
I have to be okay.

01:01:50.094 --> 01:01:51.136 line:80%
It's my fault…

01:01:59.895 --> 01:02:00.980 line:80%
I'm sorry.

01:02:04.400 --> 01:02:05.943 line:80%
I'm really sorry.

01:02:12.282 --> 01:02:14.618 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:02:15.119 --> 01:02:17.496 line:20%
[Haran] <i>Where are you?</i>
<i>Why aren't you picking up?</i>

01:02:17.579 --> 01:02:18.872 line:20%
<i>Did something happen?</i>

01:02:18.956 --> 01:02:20.624 line:20%
<i>Why can't I reach you?</i>

01:02:20.708 --> 01:02:21.959 line:20%
<i>I'm getting worried.</i>

01:02:22.042 --> 01:02:24.336 line:20%
<i>Is there something wrong? </i>[sighs deeply]

01:02:29.842 --> 01:02:31.301 line:80%
[line ringing]

01:02:32.219 --> 01:02:33.220 line:80%
[sighs]

01:02:34.179 --> 01:02:35.180 line:80%
[woman on phone] <i>Hello?</i>

01:02:35.973 --> 01:02:36.974 line:80%
Hello?

01:02:37.891 --> 01:02:38.934 line:80%
Who is this?

01:02:46.525 --> 01:02:48.652 line:80%
[♪ melancholic music playing]

01:02:54.158 --> 01:02:55.159 line:80%
[Chan weakly] Hey.

01:02:55.701 --> 01:02:56.702 line:80%
Did you cry?

01:02:57.619 --> 01:02:58.704 line:80%
I'm okay.

01:02:58.787 --> 01:03:00.497 line:80%
Let's go to the restaurant.

01:03:05.794 --> 01:03:07.171 line:80%
I'm really fine.

01:03:07.254 --> 01:03:08.630 line:80%
Why are you lying?

01:03:09.214 --> 01:03:10.299 line:80%
You're not okay.

01:03:11.133 --> 01:03:12.801 line:80%
I heard the doctors talking.

01:03:14.136 --> 01:03:16.388 line:80%
What's inside your head?

01:03:21.602 --> 01:03:24.480 line:80%
[doctor] The shrapnel's still lodged deep
in the temporal bone.

01:03:24.563 --> 01:03:28.150 line:80%
It's right next to the facial nerve,
so there's a high risk of nerve damage.

01:03:28.233 --> 01:03:30.319 line:80%
These are the follow-up records.

01:03:30.402 --> 01:03:33.322 line:80%
It went through the petrous part
and even involved the IAC.

01:03:33.405 --> 01:03:35.658 line:80%
That's how he got his hearing loss.

01:03:35.741 --> 01:03:38.118 line:80%
Was it the accident
where you lost your hearing?

01:03:39.119 --> 01:03:41.747 line:80%
If there's something in there,
it's dangerous.

01:03:48.962 --> 01:03:51.423 line:80%
I'm not someone who will leave
in three months,

01:03:51.507 --> 01:03:53.884 line:80%
nor someone who might never come back.

01:03:54.593 --> 01:03:55.719 line:80%
Ms. Song, I want to stay

01:03:57.179 --> 01:03:58.180 line:80%
with you.

01:04:00.975 --> 01:04:02.476 line:80%
No, Haran.

01:04:02.559 --> 01:04:03.769 line:80%
So I'll tell you everything.

01:04:03.852 --> 01:04:06.563 line:80%
I'll tell you all about the shrapnel
in my head, my ear,

01:04:07.856 --> 01:04:10.526 line:80%
and about the scars on my body.

01:04:10.609 --> 01:04:11.944 line:80%
I'll tell you what happened,

01:04:12.945 --> 01:04:16.198 line:80%
But to tell you everything precisely,

01:04:16.281 --> 01:04:17.866 line:80%
I need some time.

01:04:17.950 --> 01:04:19.284 line:80%
It won't take long.

01:04:19.994 --> 01:04:22.955 line:80%
I'll tell you everything honestly soon.

01:04:24.748 --> 01:04:26.792 line:80%
I'll lay my heart bare.

01:04:27.876 --> 01:04:30.212 line:80%
So when I do,

01:04:30.921 --> 01:04:32.297 line:80%
please listen to everything.

01:04:32.381 --> 01:04:33.382 line:80%
[exhales]

01:04:34.133 --> 01:04:35.634 line:80%
What if you're not okay?

01:04:35.718 --> 01:04:37.136 line:80%
What if something else happens?

01:04:37.219 --> 01:04:40.347 line:80%
I've been okay, I'm okay now,
and I'll keep being okay.

01:04:40.431 --> 01:04:41.432 line:80%
So…

01:04:42.975 --> 01:04:44.018 line:80%
let's go see

01:04:46.937 --> 01:04:48.856 line:80%
the cherry blossoms in spring.

01:04:49.606 --> 01:04:52.318 line:80%
We'll have shaved ice in summer,

01:04:52.401 --> 01:04:54.737 line:80%
see the autumn leaves in fall,

01:04:55.404 --> 01:04:56.613 line:80%
and in winter…

01:04:58.365 --> 01:05:00.534 line:80%
it would be fun to go snowboarding.

01:05:01.118 --> 01:05:02.119 line:80%
[sighs]

01:05:03.120 --> 01:05:04.455 line:80%
You're awake.

01:05:04.538 --> 01:05:06.415 line:80%
Could you leave for a moment?

01:05:07.374 --> 01:05:08.459 line:80%
Stop crying.

01:05:09.501 --> 01:05:11.378 line:80%
I'll just get checked and leave soon.

01:05:15.924 --> 01:05:18.260 line:80%
THE SURFACES, BORDERS,
AND TRANSMITTING STRUCTURES

01:05:20.179 --> 01:05:21.764 line:80%
-[Sujin exclaim]
-[objects clattering]

01:05:21.847 --> 01:05:23.599 line:80%
[Haran exclaims] Are you okay?

01:05:23.682 --> 01:05:25.434 line:80%
[Sujin] Gosh. [grunts]

01:05:31.148 --> 01:05:33.150 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

01:05:37.029 --> 01:05:38.530 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>No, just my roommate.</i>

01:05:38.614 --> 01:05:39.990 line:80%
[cellphone vibrating]

01:05:48.624 --> 01:05:50.334 line:80%
-[Sujin] Here.
-Thank you.

01:05:51.960 --> 01:05:53.796 line:80%
I think you dropped your bracelet.

01:05:56.215 --> 01:05:57.508 line:80%
This is yours, right?

01:06:02.471 --> 01:06:04.390 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

01:06:10.437 --> 01:06:12.815 line:80%
Oh. Hey, crybaby Song Haran!

01:06:12.898 --> 01:06:13.899 line:80%
[chuckles]

01:06:16.986 --> 01:06:17.987 line:80%
Hmm?

01:06:19.446 --> 01:06:21.448 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:06:22.866 --> 01:06:24.868 line:80%
[♪ music intensifies]

01:06:55.524 --> 01:06:57.526 line:80%
[♪ music fades, ends]

01:06:58.694 --> 01:07:00.696 line:80%
[♪ uplifting song playing]

01:07:02.197 --> 01:07:05.117 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:07:29.266 --> 01:07:31.935 line:20%
[Haran] <i>I'll make your birthday</i>
<i>even more special next year.</i>

01:07:32.019 --> 01:07:34.897 line:20%
<i>I'm going to use that trial</i>
<i>for the rest of my life.</i>

01:07:35.648 --> 01:07:37.733 line:20%
[Chan]
<i>Don't play around when it comes to her.</i>

01:07:37.816 --> 01:07:39.401 line:20%
<i>I'm going to make everything okay.</i>

01:07:39.485 --> 01:07:41.945 line:20%
[Nana sobbing] <i>I'm scared. I'm terrified.</i>

01:07:43.364 --> 01:07:44.740 line:20%
[Taeseok] <i>I didn't know.</i>

01:07:44.823 --> 01:07:47.701 line:20%
[Hayeong] <i>Why? How could you not know?</i>

01:07:47.785 --> 01:07:48.786 line:20%
How about a date tomorrow?

01:07:48.869 --> 01:07:50.704 line:20%
<i>We can watch a movie, have a nice meal,</i>

01:07:50.788 --> 01:07:52.831 line:20%
<i>and take a walk while we chat.</i>

01:07:52.915 --> 01:07:54.333 line:20%
<i>We'll do what other couples do.</i>

01:07:54.416 --> 01:07:56.585 line:20%
[Haran] <i>Seonu Chan! Where are you?</i>

01:07:56.669 --> 01:07:58.754 line:80%
I'm so relieved nothing happened.

01:08:02.299 --> 01:08:04.301 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:08:04.385 --> 01:08:06.387 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

01:08:12.267 --> 01:08:13.268 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:08:13.352 --> 01:08:14.353 line:80%
Translated by Juyoung Park